Dialogue: 4,1:27:56.83,1:28:02.71,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,150)}This is Bushi Road! (Bushi Road) Bushi Road (Bushi Road)
Dialogue: 6,1:28:02.71,1:28:09.43,ED_ROM 2,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\3a&H1f&\fad(0,1200)}{\k39}nep{\k74}pu {\k25}ka{\k16}i{\k16}ri{\k56}ku {\k12}bu{\k30}shi{\k54}ro{\k281}do!{\k67}
Dialogue: 6,1:28:02.71,1:28:09.43,ED_Eng 2,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\3a&H1f&\fad(0,1200)}The warrior's path lies through scourging lands!
Dialogue: 4,1:28:17.35,1:28:23.78,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,150)}On this frozen planet, we arrive
Dialogue: 4,1:28:23.78,1:28:29.45,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,150)}Cries of pain striking our souls
Dialogue: 4,1:28:29.45,1:28:35.83,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,150)}But what we've seen, it's dried all our tears
Dialogue: 4,1:28:35.83,1:28:42.30,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,150)}Rage and despair is how they control you!
Dialogue: 4,1:28:42.30,1:28:48.26,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,150)}One day we must fight
Dialogue: 4,1:28:48.26,1:28:51.26,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,150)}But today, our friendship will ring true
Dialogue: 4,1:28:51.26,1:28:57.94,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,750)}Unto you, chosen one, we grant the invincible Giga Road!
Dialogue: 4,1:28:58.85,1:29:04.86,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,150)}The burning, searing winds have blown my heart far away
Dialogue: 4,1:29:04.86,1:29:07.57,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,150)}God, where are you?
Dialogue: 4,1:29:07.57,1:29:10.87,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,150)}Answer our pleas!
Dialogue: 4,1:29:10.87,1:29:17.00,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,150)}But burning, shining dreams can cut through the darkness
Dialogue: 4,1:29:17.00,1:29:23.34,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,150)}That's Bushi Road! (Bushi Road) Bushi Road! (Bushi Road)
Dialogue: 6,1:29:22.50,1:29:29.47,ED_ROM 2,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\3a&H1f&\fad(0,1200)}{\k8}{\k51}nep{\k75}pu {\k20}ka{\k20}i{\k20}ri{\k49}ku {\k14}bu{\k27}shi{\k57}ro{\k302}do!{\k53}
Dialogue: 6,1:29:22.50,1:29:29.47,ED_Eng 2,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\3a&H1f&\fad(0,1200)}The warrior's path lies through scourging lands
Dialogue: 4,1:29:37.31,1:29:43.81,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,150)}"Will the future be better?" I ask myself
Dialogue: 4,1:29:43.81,1:29:46.73,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,150)}Or will this road lead me to the end?
Dialogue: 4,1:29:46.73,1:29:49.45,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,150)}Is a new era dawning?
Dialogue: 4,1:29:49.45,1:29:55.87,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,150)}The warriors fall to it, one by one, filled with regret
Dialogue: 4,1:29:55.87,1:30:02.29,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,150)}Their screams of hate will fuel the revolution!
Dialogue: 4,1:30:02.29,1:30:08.26,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,150)}One day we must separate
Dialogue: 4,1:30:08.26,1:30:11.30,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,150)}But today, our friendship will ring pure
Dialogue: 4,1:30:11.30,1:30:18.02,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,750)}Unto you, chosen one, we grant the fated Giga Road!
Dialogue: 4,1:30:18.89,1:30:24.90,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,150)}The burning, searing winds have woken up my heart right away
Dialogue: 4,1:30:24.90,1:30:27.57,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,150)}Raging flames of history, they take me
Dialogue: 4,1:30:27.57,1:30:30.95,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,150)}Burning my body to ashes!
Dialogue: 4,1:30:30.95,1:30:36.99,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,150)}But distant, hopeful dreams destroy evil completely
Dialogue: 4,1:30:36.99,1:30:43.17,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,150)}That's Bushi Road! (Bushi Road) Bushi Road! (Bushi Road)
Dialogue: 6,1:30:42.50,1:30:49.21,ED_ROM 2,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\3a&H1f&\fad(0,1200)}{\k11}{\k48}nep{\k77}pu {\k24}ka{\k17}i{\k18}ri{\k53}ku {\k10}bu{\k31}shi{\k55}ro{\k279}do!{\k48}
Dialogue: 6,1:30:42.50,1:30:49.21,ED_Eng 2,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\3a&H1f&\fad(0,1200)}The warrior's path lies through scourging lands
Dialogue: 4,1:31:09.98,1:31:13.20,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,150)}We'll always be friends
Dialogue: 4,1:31:13.20,1:31:16.24,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,150)}Even at each other's throats
Dialogue: 4,1:31:16.24,1:31:19.20,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,150)}Our friendship is eternal
Dialogue: 4,1:31:19.20,1:31:26.00,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,1200)}And unto you, chosen one, we grant this symbol of friendship, Giga Road!
Dialogue: 4,1:31:26.79,1:31:32.80,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,150)}The burning, searing winds have eroded my heart, till it fades away
Dialogue: 4,1:31:32.80,1:31:35.47,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,150)}God, where are you?
Dialogue: 4,1:31:35.47,1:31:38.76,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,150)}Answer our pleas!
Dialogue: 4,1:31:38.76,1:31:44.89,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,150)}But burning, shining dreams can cut through the darkness
Dialogue: 4,1:31:44.89,1:31:51.03,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\3a&H1f&\fad(150,150)}That's Bushi Road! (Bushi Road) Bushi Road! (Bushi Road)
Dialogue: 6,1:31:50.48,1:31:57.03,ED_ROM 2,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\3a&H1f&\fad(0,1200)}{\k39}nep{\k83}pu {\k16}ka{\k16}i{\k25}ri{\k60}ku {\k12}bu{\k25}shi{\k55}ro{\k299}do!{\k23}
Dialogue: 6,1:31:50.48,1:31:57.03,ED_Eng 2,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\3a&H1f&\fad(0,1200)}The warrior's path lies through scourging lands!
Dialogue: 4,1:31:59.41,1:32:06.12,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\3a&H1f&\fad(0,1200)}The warrior's path lies through scourging lands!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.12,1:32:09.13,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.13,1:32:12.13,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.13,1:32:15.13,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.13,1:32:18.14,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.14,1:32:21.14,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.14,1:32:24.14,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.14,1:32:27.15,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:25.25,0:00:28.46,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,{\an8}Sensei, I want to ride on the Giga Road.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:30.13,0:00:32.43,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,{\an8}Holy Weapon Giga Road:
Dialogue: 99,0:00:32.43,0:00:34.35,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,{\an8}a legendary relic passed on by an ancient civilization.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:34.93,0:00:38.43,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,It is said to be able to eradicate the Shinobi thus purifying the world.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:38.43,0:00:40.27,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,A legendary weapon.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:42.06,0:00:43.56,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Incredible, isn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:43.56,0:00:47.11,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,If it is you, Ame-sama, you will definitely find it.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:49.03,0:00:50.11,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:53.99,0:00:58.29,Default,Nar,0,0,0,,500 years after the downfall of a civilization that once touched the heavens,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:58.87,0:01:03.42,Default,Nar,0,0,0,,evil descended upon the Earth and struck fear into the hearts of the remaining human population.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:03.42,0:01:06.38,Default,Nar,0,0,0,,They are the Shinobi, the ultimate evil.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:21.89,0:01:24.19,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,I've finally taken the Ise Castle.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:26.44,0:01:29.28,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Now it's only a matter of time.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:35.45,0:01:37.33,Default,Kag,0,0,0,,What a horrific sight.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:37.33,0:01:40.12,Default,Kag,0,0,0,,It's been a while since Ise was attacked.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:40.12,0:01:42.21,Default,Kag,0,0,0,,More so, isn't their numbers increasing?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:42.21,0:01:43.46,Default,Follower,0,0,0,,Yes, they are.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:43.46,0:01:46.71,Default,Kag,0,0,0,,Report our observations to Shin-sama. That is all for today.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:46.71,0:01:47.71,Default,Fol,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:03.02,0:02:05.27,Default,Yuz,0,0,0,,The princess isn't in the best of spirits nowadays.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:05.27,0:02:06.40,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Of course she isn't.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:06.40,0:02:09.52,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,How long has it been since we left the castle?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:09.52,0:02:10.48,Default,Eri,0,0,0,,Three months.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:10.48,0:02:12.24,Default,Han,0,0,0,,Hey, Rin, Yuzu.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:12.82,0:02:15.86,Default,Han,0,0,0,,Hurry up and finish your work so you can help out over here.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:15.86,0:02:16.91,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:16.91,0:02:17.70,Default,Han,0,0,0,,Yuzu.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:17.70,0:02:19.20,Default,Yuz,0,0,0,,Isn't lunch ready yet?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:19.20,0:02:20.16,Default,Han,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:22.12,0:02:27.08,Default,San,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be better if you rested in your room?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:29.96,0:02:31.25,Default,San,0,0,0,,Princess.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:31.90,0:03:33.44,Default,Man,0,0,0,,No way. The Shinobi are coming!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:33.44,0:03:35.23,Default,Man,0,0,0,,They've broken through the barrier!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:35.23,0:03:36.03,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Where's the priestess?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:36.03,0:03:38.15,Default,Man,0,0,0,,What is she doing?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:41.99,0:03:44.16,Default,Ame's Mom,0,0,0,,Please go, Ame.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:44.16,0:03:45.04,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:47.79,0:03:51.00,Default,AM,0,0,0,,This is Ise's royal family inheritance.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:51.00,0:03:52.96,Default,AM,0,0,0,,It will protect you.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:52.96,0:03:53.67,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,But!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:54.88,0:03:55.59,Default,AM,0,0,0,,Sanda.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:55.59,0:03:57.38,Default,San,0,0,0,,Princess, this way.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:56.17,0:03:57.38,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,{\an8\3c&H523B4D&}No!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:07.18,0:04:07.77,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:07.77,0:04:09.39,Default,San,0,0,0,,Princess, you mustn't.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:10.85,0:04:12.10,Default,AM,0,0,0,,Shinobi,
Dialogue: 99,0:04:12.10,0:04:14.73,Default,AM,0,0,0,,I will not run or hide.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:14.73,0:04:16.48,Default,AM,0,0,0,,As the Priestess of Ise,
Dialogue: 99,0:04:16.48,0:04:19.74,Default,AM,0,0,0,,I accept my punishment for summoning you here.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:37.05,0:04:38.55,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Sanda, stop.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:48.35,0:04:49.60,Default,San,0,0,0,,Is it the Shinobi?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:49.60,0:04:51.39,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Yes, I can feel them.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:54.48,0:04:55.44,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:55.44,0:04:57.82,Default,Woman,0,0,0,,Saki! Saki!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:59.53,0:05:00.90,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:00.90,0:05:02.70,Default,San,0,0,0,,They're offering a human sacrifice.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:03.11,0:05:06.33,Default,San,0,0,0,,Some people believe that by offering sacrifices to the Shinobi,
Dialogue: 99,0:05:06.33,0:05:09.75,Default,San,0,0,0,,they can appease them.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:09.75,0:05:12.08,Default,San,0,0,0,,It's a rudimentary way of thinking, though.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:13.50,0:05:15.13,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,That's stuff happening everywhere,
Dialogue: 99,0:05:15.13,0:05:17.38,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,so no reason to drive like that.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:17.38,0:05:19.59,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Hey, Eri, help me pick these things up.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:19.59,0:05:20.72,Default,Yuz,0,0,0,,Look, it's the princess.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:24.34,0:05:25.97,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Stop this madness at once.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:25.97,0:05:29.93,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Offering a sacrifice will not stop the Shinobi.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:30.39,0:05:32.98,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Free this child immediately.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:34.35,0:05:38.15,Default,Village Chief,0,0,0,,Young girl, I'm the chief of this village.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:38.15,0:05:39.69,Default,VC,0,0,0,,Do not interfere.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:41.90,0:05:44.20,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,The presence of the Shinobi is building up.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:44.20,0:05:45.82,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,You must hurry and leave this place at once.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:46.49,0:05:48.37,Default,San,0,0,0,,Everyone, get the Shields ready.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:48.37,0:05:49.20,Default,San,0,0,0,,Be quick.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:49.20,0:05:49.91,Default,Yuu,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:49.91,0:05:51.16,Default,RIn,0,0,0,,What? Now?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:51.16,0:05:53.58,Default,San,0,0,0,,Hana, open the hatch on Ame-sama's signal.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:53.58,0:05:54.33,Default,Han,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:54.33,0:05:57.38,Default,San,0,0,0,,Rin, Yuzu, Eri, start up Ame-sama's Shield.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:57.38,0:05:58.00,Default,Rin; Yuzu; Eri,0,0,0,,{\an8\3c&H523B4D&}Okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:57.38,0:05:58.00,Default,Rin; Yuzu; Eri,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:58.00,0:05:59.50,Default,VC,0,0,0,,Back off.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:59.50,0:06:03.67,Default,VC,0,0,0,,If you interfere, we'll fire upon you.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:05.09,0:06:06.09,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:09.35,0:06:10.06,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Sanda.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:12.48,0:06:13.81,Default,Village people,0,0,0,,A Shield.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:13.81,0:06:15.48,Default,VP,0,0,0,,A real one.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:18.52,0:06:20.40,Default,VC,0,0,0,,Shinobi? Impossible!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:31.04,0:06:32.87,Default,Woman,0,0,0,,Saki! Saki!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:48.76,0:06:50.76,Default,San,0,0,0,,Stay back. It's not dead yet.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:54.48,0:06:55.02,Default,San,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:57.44,0:06:58.77,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,The rest is up to you.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:58.77,0:06:59.65,Default,Han,0,0,0,,Leave it to us.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:59.11,0:06:59.65,Default,Yuz,0,0,0,,{\an8\3c&H523B4D&}Okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:08.07,0:07:10.16,Default,San,0,0,0,,Ame-sama, I've taken care of this one.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:10.99,0:07:12.37,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Don't let your guard down.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:12.79,0:07:14.75,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I can still sense their presence.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:15.66,0:07:16.71,Default,Woman,0,0,0,,Saki.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:22.34,0:07:22.88,Default,San,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:32.76,0:07:33.76,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:38.19,0:07:39.60,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Sanda, please.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:39.15,0:07:39.60,Default,San,0,0,0,,{\an8\3c&H523B4D&}Okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:45.53,0:07:46.99,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Everyone, find shelter.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:47.78,0:07:48.74,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Come on, move!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:53.08,0:07:53.99,Default,San,0,0,0,,Ame-sama?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:53.99,0:07:55.20,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I can still sense them.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:55.20,0:07:55.83,Default,San,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:56.37,0:07:57.75,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Deep inside the valley,
Dialogue: 99,0:07:57.75,0:08:00.25,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I sense a very strong presence.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:00.67,0:08:02.17,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Sanda, take care of things here.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:02.17,0:08:03.13,Default,San,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:09.43,0:08:11.55,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,The presence is getting stronger.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:18.02,0:08:20.73,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,The remains of a Shinobi {\i1}and{\i0} human blood?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:21.56,0:08:24.73,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I can still sense a strong presence.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:28.32,0:08:29.32,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:29.32,0:08:31.91,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Multiple Shinobi are intertwined together?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:39.91,0:08:41.33,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Is he human?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:09.82,0:09:10.32,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:16.20,0:09:16.62,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:33.26,0:09:34.80,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Not good! The village is that way.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:42.06,0:09:42.85,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Sanda.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:42.85,0:09:44.52,Default,San,0,0,0,,Ame-sama, you're all right.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:44.52,0:09:45.65,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I apologize.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:45.65,0:09:48.23,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,There's a Shinobi heading your way.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:48.23,0:09:49.40,Default,San,0,0,0,,I'll deal with it.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:59.41,0:10:00.20,Default,San,0,0,0,,It's fast.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:02.87,0:10:03.29,Default,San,0,0,0,,What the—
Dialogue: 99,0:10:06.54,0:10:08.79,Default,VP,0,0,0,,There it is. It's coming.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:49.25,0:10:50.79,Default,VP,0,0,0,,A-A monster.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:58.05,0:10:59.14,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Help me.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:16.49,0:11:18.45,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:18.45,0:11:22.16,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,This person defeated the Shinobi and protected your village.{Editor Note: may want to put "your" in italics}
Dialogue: 99,0:11:22.16,0:11:23.37,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:29.33,0:11:31.25,Default,VC,0,0,0,,What are all of these?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:31.25,0:11:32.38,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Food supplies.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:33.30,0:11:36.51,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I know these are not enough
Dialogue: 99,0:11:36.51,0:11:38.93,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,to feed everyone in the village.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:39.97,0:11:40.97,Default,VC,0,0,0,,Then why?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:40.97,0:11:43.31,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,After taking care of our business,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:43.31,0:11:45.27,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,we'll definitely return.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:45.93,0:11:48.85,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,And when that time comes, if that girl is not alive...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:53.69,0:11:55.03,Default,Sak,0,0,0,,Onee-chan.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:55.86,0:11:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:58.03,0:11:59.41,Default,Sak,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:03.53,0:12:04.66,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:17.76,0:12:20.84,Default,Yuz,0,0,0,,Is it really all right to let this good-for-nothing guy in?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:20.84,0:12:23.05,Default,Han,0,0,0,,The princess said it is.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:23.05,0:12:24.76,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,He's pretty handsome actually.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:24.76,0:12:25.64,Default,Han,0,0,0,,Hey, Rin!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:25.64,0:12:27.85,Default,Eri,0,0,0,,From the looks of it, he's sustained number of wounds;
Dialogue: 99,0:12:27.85,0:12:30.64,Default,Eri,0,0,0,,however, he doesn't seem to be affected by the Shinobi's poison.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:30.64,0:12:33.36,Default,Han,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right. He's one lucky kid.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:46.79,0:12:48.25,Default,San,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:49.96,0:12:51.92,Default,San,0,0,0,,We'll be camping out for the night.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:52.29,0:12:55.00,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:56.30,0:12:58.84,Default,Yuz,0,0,0,,Is he really alive?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:58.84,0:13:00.30,Default,Han,0,0,0,,Well, he is still breathing.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:05.22,0:13:07.43,Default,Han,0,0,0,,Um, are you okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:11.89,0:13:13.31,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Is he dead?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:13.31,0:13:14.31,Default,Yuz,0,0,0,,Ran out of batteries?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:14.31,0:13:16.07,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Everyone, thank you for your hard work today.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:18.15,0:13:20.15,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,You should give him something to eat.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:23.99,0:13:25.49,Default,Han,0,0,0,,Wow, he's got an impressive appetite.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:25.91,0:13:27.58,Default,Eri,0,0,0,,He's eating three times as much as Sanda.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:30.16,0:13:31.37,Default,Han,0,0,0,,Rin, get us some water.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:31.37,0:13:31.91,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:38.21,0:13:39.96,Default,San,0,0,0,,You can move already?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:39.96,0:13:40.80,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,What are those?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:41.17,0:13:42.51,Default,San,0,0,0,,Shinobi repellent.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:42.51,0:13:43.93,Default,San,0,0,0,,Have you never seen one before?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:43.93,0:13:46.76,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Can the Shinobi be defeated using those?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:47.39,0:13:48.85,Default,San,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:48.85,0:13:50.60,Default,San,0,0,0,,It just keeps them away.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:50.60,0:13:53.14,Default,San,0,0,0,,I don't understand the theory behind them, but all that matters is that they work.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:53.14,0:13:53.81,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:55.40,0:13:58.52,Default,San,0,0,0,,Since you can walk, why don't you introduce yourself to the princess?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:59.15,0:14:00.11,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Princess?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:00.11,0:14:03.32,Default,San,0,0,0,,She was really worried about you.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:07.78,0:14:08.87,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:48.28,0:14:50.12,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Sorry if I surprised you.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:50.70,0:14:54.41,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,It's just that no one's ever seen me like this before.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:54.41,0:14:55.54,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:55.54,0:14:57.04,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Have you eaten?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:57.04,0:14:59.21,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Yup, the rice was delicious.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:00.54,0:15:01.80,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:01.80,0:15:04.72,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Everyone was shocked when you suddenly collapsed.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:05.42,0:15:08.89,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Well, it's just that I got a little hungry and couldn't move.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:10.43,0:15:12.22,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,This is yours.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:12.22,0:15:13.64,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Oh, you can keep that.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:13.64,0:15:15.77,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,No, thanks. It reeks of perfume.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:22.02,0:15:24.61,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,See, it hasn't healed yet.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:24.61,0:15:26.36,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,That's because of you.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:28.45,0:15:29.24,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:29.78,0:15:32.66,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Nothing. What's your name?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:32.66,0:15:33.66,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Suou.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:33.66,0:15:34.83,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Suou.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:45.76,0:15:47.42,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,You're a Yagyuu.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:49.89,0:15:50.76,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:51.43,0:15:54.10,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,So, please fight alongside me.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:54.10,0:15:56.73,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,To erase the Shinobi from this world.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:56.73,0:15:58.19,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Erase the Shinobi?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:59.69,0:16:02.48,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,My country was destroyed by the Shinobi.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:04.53,0:16:07.28,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Only once I destroy every single Shinobi will this world finally find peace.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:07.82,0:16:09.28,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,The Shinobi must be destroyed.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:09.82,0:16:13.62,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,And to accomplish that, we need your power as a Yagyuu.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:13.62,0:16:17.33,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I'll give you anything you want like money or even food.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:18.66,0:16:20.12,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Fight by my side!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:24.59,0:16:25.59,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:25.59,0:16:27.55,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I must refuse.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:28.09,0:16:31.93,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I'm not as strong as you think.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:31.93,0:16:34.18,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,That's wrong. Back there, you...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:34.18,0:16:36.81,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,If I were strong, shouldn't I be happy?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:40.48,0:16:43.27,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I'm the same as the Shinobi.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:43.27,0:16:44.48,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,A monster.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:52.70,0:16:53.66,Default,San,0,0,0,,Princess.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:54.28,0:16:56.62,Default,San,0,0,0,,Isn't the boy with you?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:57.24,0:17:00.96,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I see. He didn't come back after all.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:02.21,0:17:04.33,Default,San,0,0,0,,First, let's go inside.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:10.92,0:17:11.97,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Sanda,
Dialogue: 99,0:17:12.88,0:17:14.18,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,are you familiar with the Yagyuu?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:14.72,0:17:18.85,Default,San,0,0,0,,When I was child, there were many pure Yagyuu.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:18.85,0:17:23.90,Default,San,0,0,0,,In fact, my partner in the military was one as well.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:23.90,0:17:27.36,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Really? Then Suou really...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:27.36,0:17:29.82,Default,San,0,0,0,,Bears the blood of a Yagyuu.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:29.82,0:17:33.41,Default,San,0,0,0,,And here I thought that bloodline no longer existed.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:34.53,0:17:36.53,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,The sky with the Giga Road,
Dialogue: 99,0:17:36.53,0:17:37.87,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,the Earth with the Yagyuu.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:37.87,0:17:41.29,Default,San,0,0,0,,I've heard that the Yagyuu were created by humans—
Dialogue: 99,0:17:41.29,0:17:44.46,Default,San,0,0,0,,a living weapon designed to destroy the Shinobi.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:44.96,0:17:48.67,Default,San,30,30,0,,But the Yagyuu's power were immense and their\N fearsome appearances proved to be their undoing.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:48.67,0:17:50.92,Default,San,0,0,0,,In the end, they were persecuted.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:50.92,0:17:55.68,Default,San,0,0,0,,Forced to leave their homelands, they disappeared in the border regions.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:56.14,0:17:59.43,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Do you think the Yagyuu hate us?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:59.43,0:18:00.72,Default,San,0,0,0,,Sometimes I wonder about that myself.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:01.81,0:18:07.94,Default,San,0,0,0,,But he didn't even do anything, even after they threw a stone at him.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:32.80,0:18:33.67,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Suou!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:34.09,0:18:37.97,Default,San,0,0,0,,This guy deactivated all of the Shinobi repellent.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:38.47,0:18:39.93,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,These are not needed.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:39.93,0:18:42.27,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,If the Shinobi appear, I will defeat all of them.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:43.31,0:18:44.18,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,That means...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:44.18,0:18:45.56,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I'm going with you.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:46.10,0:18:50.52,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,You saved me when I was about to be eaten by the Shinobi.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:50.52,0:18:53.61,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,That is why I'll give you my life and follow you until the very end.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:57.82,0:18:59.62,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:59.62,0:19:01.58,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I thought we wouldn't be able to see each other again.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:01.58,0:19:03.87,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,But let me make something clear:
Dialogue: 99,0:19:04.62,0:19:08.08,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,You're not a monster,
Dialogue: 99,0:19:08.08,0:19:10.63,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,and certainly not a Shinobi.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:11.25,0:19:14.76,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I can tell because of your beautiful eyes.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:15.72,0:19:18.22,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,That hue is called the color of the sky.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:19.22,0:19:23.81,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,The sky used to be filled with your eye's color.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:23.81,0:19:26.31,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Even though I've only seen it through pictures,
Dialogue: 99,0:19:26.31,0:19:27.60,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,it was beautiful.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:27.60,0:19:30.81,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,If you see it, I know you'll love it.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:34.61,0:19:35.61,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,What a strange woman.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:35.61,0:19:38.20,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,What do you mea—
Dialogue: 99,0:19:36.95,0:19:38.20,Alternative,Yuz,0,0,0,,Hold up, hold up.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:38.20,0:19:40.20,Default,Yuz,0,0,0,,There's something fishy going on here!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:40.70,0:19:42.66,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,So enthusiastic.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:42.66,0:19:45.29,Default,Han,0,0,0,,Yuzu thinks that the princess will be taken away.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:45.29,0:19:48.92,Default,Yuz,0,0,0,,Did you express your gratitude to our princess?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:49.33,0:19:52.54,Default,Yuz,0,0,0,,The princess had to fight hard in order to save you, you know?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:52.54,0:19:55.01,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Yuzu, that's already in the past.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:55.01,0:19:56.13,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:56.55,0:19:57.30,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:02.43,0:20:03.47,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:03.93,0:20:07.48,Default,Yuz,0,0,0,,Hey, what's with your attitude toward the princess?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:09.02,0:20:09.98,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:09.98,0:20:12.02,Default,Yuz,0,0,0,,Totally unacceptable!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:13.02,0:20:15.98,Default,Yuz,0,0,0,,Princess, please tell him off.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:16.69,0:20:18.74,Default,San,0,0,0,,All right, let's get going.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:23.95,0:20:25.79,Default,San,0,0,0,,Suou, wear this.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:26.37,0:20:31.37,Default,San,0,0,0,,My partner gave it to me when I was in the military.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:31.37,0:20:33.17,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,What a hassle.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:33.17,0:20:35.59,Default,San,0,0,0,,You are traveling with the princess.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:35.59,0:20:38.01,Default,San,0,0,0,,At the very least wear something appropriate.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:39.17,0:20:40.26,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:45.68,0:20:48.27,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,So, where are we headed?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:48.81,0:20:49.94,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,The Old Land.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:49.94,0:20:51.02,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,The Old Land?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:51.02,0:20:54.36,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,It used to be a city filled with people.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:54.36,0:20:57.73,Default,Yuz,0,0,0,,However, a meteor or something landed there and triggered all sorts of unnatural phenomena.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:58.28,0:21:02.61,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,The terrain morphs, the air is laced with poison, and many other oddities occur in the area.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:02.61,0:21:04.28,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,As we speak,
Dialogue: 99,0:21:04.28,0:21:08.25,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,there's a huge sandstorm barring access to the Old Land.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:08.25,0:21:11.04,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Those who've tried to reach it have never returned.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:11.04,0:21:12.54,Default,Han,0,0,0,,However, we mustn't back down.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:12.54,0:21:15.09,Default,Han,0,0,0,,The Holy Weapon is somewhere in that area,
Dialogue: 99,0:21:15.09,0:21:15.96,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Holy Weapon?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:16.55,0:21:18.38,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,The Holy Weapon Giga Road
Dialogue: 99,0:21:18.38,0:21:21.55,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,It is said to be able to eradicate the Shinobi thus purifying the world.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:22.18,0:21:24.93,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Most people say it's only a legend.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:24.93,0:21:26.10,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,However, I know it exists.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:27.26,0:21:30.68,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,This stone has been passed down through the Ise royal family.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:30.68,0:21:33.35,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Is said to be the key to the Holy Weapon.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:33.35,0:21:35.31,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,The stone is the key?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:35.31,0:21:37.65,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Yes, and I'm the one who inherited the key.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:37.65,0:21:39.78,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,That is why I must do it!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:40.24,0:21:43.03,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I have to somehow find a route into the Old Land.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:43.03,0:21:44.87,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I think I know the way in.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:45.41,0:21:46.95,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I remember,
Dialogue: 99,0:21:46.95,0:21:51.71,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,in the village where I was raised, they said it's where everything started,
Dialogue: 99,0:21:51.71,0:21:53.79,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,the birthplace of our kind, a holy place.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:53.79,0:21:54.92,Default,San,0,0,0,,Where everything started.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:55.46,0:21:58.50,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I think it refers to the Old Land.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:58.50,0:22:01.55,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,The villagers also said that it's the start of the road to the Old Land.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:10.06,0:22:11.47,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I believe in Suou.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:12.27,0:22:14.64,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Let's go, to where everything began.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:15.10,0:22:16.31,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's go,
Dialogue: 99,0:22:16.90,0:22:18.69,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,and find this Holy Weapon.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:22.57,0:22:24.86,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Suou, is this the place?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:24.86,0:22:27.82,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Yeah, the shape of those rocks look familiar.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:27.82,0:22:28.62,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,It's here.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:28.62,0:22:29.58,Default,San,0,0,0,,Princess,
Dialogue: 99,0:22:29.58,0:22:33.04,Default,San,0,0,0,,even if this is the road to the Old Land,
Dialogue: 99,0:22:33.04,0:22:34.87,Default,San,0,0,0,,we mustn't be too hopeful.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:34.87,0:22:37.00,Default,San,0,0,0,,Many have left in search of the Old Land.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:37.00,0:22:40.67,Default,San,0,0,0,,However, they were no match against the sandstorm and no one came back alive.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:40.67,0:22:41.88,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:14.29,0:23:17.17,Default,San,0,0,0,,The Yagyuu are terrifying beings.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:17.17,0:23:19.79,Default,San,0,0,0,,They can even survive in these harsh conditions.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:20.34,0:23:22.34,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Indeed, it's a miracle.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:22.34,0:23:25.88,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to Suou that we can now reach the Old Land.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:32.43,0:23:35.23,Default,San,0,0,0,,What's this? Our Shields are losing power.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:35.89,0:23:37.02,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:39.90,0:23:40.65,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,What are those?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:42.19,0:23:44.07,Default,San,0,0,0,,These are all Shields.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:44.07,0:23:47.36,Default,San,0,0,0,,I bet these are the ones that tried to find the Old Land.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:47.36,0:23:48.82,Default,San,0,0,0,,Only their husks remain.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:50.20,0:23:51.12,Default,San,0,0,0,,I figured it out!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:51.66,0:23:53.03,Default,San,0,0,0,,it's beryllium.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:53.03,0:23:57.08,Default,San,0,0,0,,Absorbing too much beryllium will cause the Shield's engines to deteriorate.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:57.58,0:24:01.04,Default,San,0,0,0,,But more importantly, concentrated beryllium
Dialogue: 99,0:24:01.04,0:24:03.04,Default,San,0,0,0,,is lethal to humans.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:03.50,0:24:03.96,Default,San,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:16.02,0:24:18.81,Default,Han,0,0,0,,Though he looks ragged, old Sanda can be quite reliable at times.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:18.81,0:24:20.81,Default,Han,0,0,0,,However, Suou is with them.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:20.81,0:24:21.94,Default,Han,0,0,0,,I'm sure they'll be fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:24.44,0:24:26.40,Default,San,0,0,0,,Princess, please stop.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:26.40,0:24:27.61,Default,San,0,0,0,,It is too dangerous.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:27.99,0:24:29.24,Default,San,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:29.24,0:24:30.57,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 99,0:24:31.82,0:24:33.78,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Wait, Suou.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:34.58,0:24:37.54,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,We... both... together...
Dialogue: 99,0:24:38.20,0:24:40.12,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Holy Weapon...
Dialogue: 99,0:24:44.67,0:24:45.88,Default,San,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:46.38,0:24:49.72,Default,San,0,0,0,,You mustn't. We must head back!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:51.47,0:24:53.89,Default,San,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:56.60,0:24:58.02,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Just a little more.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:58.64,0:25:00.56,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Just a little farther.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:10.45,0:25:12.74,Default,San,0,0,0,,Princess...
Dialogue: 99,0:25:32.68,0:25:34.05,Default,Voice,0,0,0,,Targets acquired.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:34.05,0:25:35.14,Default,Voice,0,0,0,,2 Shields.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:35.14,0:25:36.10,Default,Voice,0,0,0,,One red and one green.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:36.64,0:25:38.06,Default,Voice,0,0,0,,We'll take them away.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:46.61,0:25:48.73,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Ise's remaining survivors, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:25:49.53,0:25:52.45,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,What a silly thing to do.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:27.15,0:26:30.57,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,This is… Toarai's castle.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:49.67,0:26:50.59,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,Excuse us.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:51.59,0:26:53.17,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:55.01,0:26:57.80,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,I am the Captain of Toarai's Imperial Guard,
Dialogue: 99,0:26:57.80,0:26:59.80,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,Hashiba Hinata at your service.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:00.22,0:27:01.89,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,I apologize for my abruptness,
Dialogue: 99,0:27:02.43,0:27:04.52,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,but there's someone I would like you to meet.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:09.06,0:27:11.48,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,Your companions are also safe with us.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:11.48,0:27:14.49,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Thank you very much for saving us.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:14.49,0:27:16.78,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,You're welcome. But you were lucky.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:16.78,0:27:20.70,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,Without an antidote, the beryllium would've poisoned you to death.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:21.78,0:27:22.54,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:22.99,0:27:25.87,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,You guys must've been quite determined since you barged straight into the middle of the storm—
Dialogue: 99,0:27:25.87,0:27:26.96,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,a courageous act.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:28.29,0:27:29.33,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:29.33,0:27:30.92,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,We're now entering the underground.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:46.48,0:27:48.23,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,A strange sight, isn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:27:50.94,0:27:54.98,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,Formerly, a garden like this bore a meaningful culture.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:57.61,0:27:59.99,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,Shin-sama, I've brought her.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:00.53,0:28:02.95,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Thanks for doing all of this.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:06.50,0:28:08.04,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Isn't this place relaxing?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:08.04,0:28:10.00,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,It's my own personal retreat.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:10.00,0:28:12.59,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Only those I trust are allowed to enter this place.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:13.63,0:28:17.05,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I am the Great Ambassador of Toarai, Kazusa Shin.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:17.42,0:28:18.84,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Great Ambassador?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:19.22,0:28:20.34,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I am—
Dialogue: 99,0:28:20.34,0:28:22.18,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,The Princess of Ise, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:22.55,0:28:25.27,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,The news of Ise's destruction by the Shinobi
Dialogue: 99,0:28:25.27,0:28:28.02,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,has spread like wildfire.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:28.39,0:28:30.73,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Also, there were a number of Shields in your trailer,
Dialogue: 99,0:28:30.73,0:28:33.82,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,some of which are of infamous character.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:34.27,0:28:39.28,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Above all, after seeing the stone you were wearing, I no longer have any doubt.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:40.20,0:28:42.45,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,The stone... Where's the stone?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:42.45,0:28:43.62,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,You needn't worry.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:44.24,0:28:46.95,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I'm keeping it to make sure it's safe.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:47.66,0:28:49.41,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Would you kindly return it to me?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:49.41,0:28:50.42,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:51.17,0:28:55.55,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I cannot allow such a dangerous item to wander around in Toarai.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:56.42,0:28:57.51,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,The stone.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:57.51,0:28:59.38,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,You know exactly what it is, don't you?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:59.38,0:29:03.01,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Judging by that stern face of yours, I believe so.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:03.59,0:29:06.56,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,You must have inherited the key from Ise's priestess—
Dialogue: 99,0:29:06.56,0:29:08.06,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,the key to the Holy Weapon.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:08.68,0:29:12.23,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Yes, it was my mother's whom the Shinobi killed.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:12.23,0:29:13.44,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Please give it back to me.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:14.27,0:29:16.19,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Give up on the Holy Weapon,
Dialogue: 99,0:29:16.19,0:29:18.07,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,and never approach the Old Land ever again.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:18.61,0:29:22.16,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,The Holy Weapon's not a tool to be used to avenge the death of one's parents.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:22.16,0:29:23.99,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,What do you even know?
Dialogue: 99,0:29:23.99,0:29:26.49,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have to take orders from you.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:26.87,0:29:28.33,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Give me back my stone immediately.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:28.75,0:29:30.08,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Don't get me wrong.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:30.08,0:29:32.71,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,While you're still a princess, you have no country to reign over.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:33.54,0:29:35.17,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,And if it wasn't for our help,
Dialogue: 99,0:29:35.17,0:29:38.46,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,you would've perished along with the others that challenged the sandstorm.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:38.46,0:29:41.47,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,In fact, I'm the one who shouldn't even have to listen to you.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:42.63,0:29:46.26,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,But without the key, I…
Dialogue: 99,0:29:46.26,0:29:48.51,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I already advised you to give up on it.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:48.97,0:29:53.14,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,If you don't, I cannot guarantee the safety of you and your companions.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:55.48,0:29:56.52,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 99,0:29:57.15,0:29:59.07,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 99,0:29:59.07,0:30:01.94,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Are you planning to use the Holy Weapon as well?
Dialogue: 99,0:30:01.94,0:30:03.32,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I'm not.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:03.32,0:30:07.83,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Only a priestess bearing the key has the right to use it.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:07.83,0:30:10.37,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,The Holy Weapon is to remain dormant for now,
Dialogue: 99,0:30:10.37,0:30:11.58,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,and for all of time.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:11.58,0:30:13.50,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,That can't be. What about the Shinobi?
Dialogue: 99,0:30:13.50,0:30:15.63,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,And the people suffering at the hands of the Shinobi?
Dialogue: 99,0:30:16.29,0:30:18.38,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,While the Holy Weapon indeed has the power to destroy the Shinobi,
Dialogue: 99,0:30:18.38,0:30:21.09,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}it also possess the power to destroy all of mankind.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:21.88,0:30:28.14,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,A weapon that exceeds mankind's knowledge would easily instill a sense of fear and desire.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:28.76,0:30:30.31,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Even with the danger that the Shinobi pose,
Dialogue: 99,0:30:30.31,0:30:32.64,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,mankind's foolishness will never change.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:33.10,0:30:38.23,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,A priestess that isolated herself from the outside world would never understand.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:39.61,0:30:40.69,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:40.69,0:30:43.99,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,It's people like you who fight and kill each other for no reason that truly don't understand!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:44.49,0:30:49.16,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I'm just someone who doesn't want to rely upon a Holy Weapon to defeat the Shinobi.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:49.16,0:30:52.08,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,We must protect ourselves using our own means.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:52.08,0:30:54.62,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Toarai is strong because of that.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:54.62,0:30:55.58,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 99,0:30:56.54,0:30:59.71,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,The lives of your people and family,
Dialogue: 99,0:30:59.71,0:31:01.63,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,were you able to protect them?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:10.43,0:31:12.01,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,It's going to rain soon.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:27.61,0:31:30.91,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Mother said that I shouldn't look for the Holy Weapon.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:30.91,0:31:33.12,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,That it isn't the right time.{She said it's too late now.}
Dialogue: 99,0:31:33.79,0:31:36.21,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,It seems I have no other choice.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:36.21,0:31:39.29,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,All humans have their own destiny.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:39.63,0:31:41.96,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,People suffer because of the Shinobi,
Dialogue: 99,0:31:41.96,0:31:47.26,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,so the only way to cure their hearts is to find the Holy Weapon.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:48.76,0:31:50.51,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Can you hear their desperate calls, Ame-sama?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:52.47,0:31:54.52,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Their yearning hearts.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:14.29,0:32:16.12,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 99,0:32:17.37,0:32:20.42,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,My apologies. I just felt a little dizzy.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:22.25,0:32:24.63,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I must've pushed you too hard.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:28.67,0:32:29.68,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 99,0:32:30.80,0:32:32.22,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Suou.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:32.22,0:32:33.97,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Stay away from her.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:34.56,0:32:37.14,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Blue eyes, white hair.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:38.64,0:32:40.81,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Suou, you misunderstand.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:40.81,0:32:42.48,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:42.48,0:32:43.31,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:32:46.78,0:32:49.90,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Boy, you have sharp eyes.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:49.90,0:32:53.32,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,But choose your opponents wisely if you value your life.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:54.12,0:32:57.12,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I don't care about my life.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:57.45,0:32:58.50,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,What a fool.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:58.50,0:32:59.25,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Suou!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:59.25,0:33:02.46,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Your princess is not in the best of shape.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:02.92,0:33:04.54,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Feel free to do as you please.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:04.54,0:33:10.09,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,You can take your followers and leave Toarai, or you can stay. It's your choice.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:10.72,0:33:12.34,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,You needn't worry.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:12.34,0:33:15.18,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,If the public nominations are closed down,
Dialogue: 99,0:33:15.18,0:33:18.02,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Toarai's army would feel uneasy.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:19.23,0:33:20.52,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,If that were to happen,
Dialogue: 99,0:33:20.52,0:33:24.27,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I'd merely abandon the old system,
Dialogue: 99,0:33:24.27,0:33:27.94,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,and create a new one fit only for the strong.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:27.94,0:33:31.74,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,A future where humans are able to kill the Shinobi is not far off.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:32.36,0:33:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And you will be able to fulfill your wish too.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:35.95,0:33:37.41,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,Is that all right?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:37.41,0:33:39.58,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I'm in possession of the stone.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:39.58,0:33:40.75,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,They can't do anything without it.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:41.54,0:33:43.08,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,I'll take your word for that.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:43.08,0:33:45.13,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,Touhi-sama would like to meet you.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:47.00,0:33:47.88,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,That old man.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:50.30,0:33:51.88,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Can you stand?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:51.88,0:33:55.18,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm fine now. Sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:55.85,0:33:57.35,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Why are you apologizing?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:57.35,0:34:00.02,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Because I...
Dialogue: 99,0:34:05.44,0:34:07.65,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,You really are a weird one.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:08.15,0:34:09.23,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:10.15,0:34:11.53,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Everyone's here, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:34:11.53,0:34:12.45,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:13.11,0:34:13.86,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:20.16,0:34:20.91,Default,Yuz,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 99,0:34:21.50,0:34:22.71,Default,All,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 99,0:34:22.71,0:34:24.21,Default,Han,0,0,0,,You're okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:24.21,0:34:26.13,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Did they hurt you?
Dialogue: 99,0:34:26.67,0:34:28.67,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I'm sorry if I worried everyone.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:28.67,0:34:30.13,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Is everyone all right?
Dialogue: 99,0:34:30.13,0:34:31.13,Default,Eri,0,0,0,,We're fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:31.13,0:34:33.05,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,We're nothing—oh...
Dialogue: 99,0:34:33.42,0:34:35.01,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Suou's safe too.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:35.01,0:34:37.22,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,We knew that you wouldn't die so easily.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:37.22,0:34:39.01,Default,Han,0,0,0,,Stop it, you guys.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:43.52,0:34:45.10,Default,San,0,0,0,,They took the key...?
Dialogue: 99,0:34:45.52,0:34:47.65,Default,San,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:47.65,0:34:49.94,Default,San,0,0,0,,It is all my fault.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:50.78,0:34:53.99,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Stop that, Sanda. I'm the one at fault.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:53.99,0:34:56.28,Default,San,0,0,0,,No. That's all nonsense.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:56.28,0:34:58.20,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,If Shin didn't mention it,
Dialogue: 99,0:34:58.20,0:34:59.62,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I never would've even noticed.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:00.37,0:35:04.46,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I thought I wanted to destroy the Shinobi for everyone's sake,
Dialogue: 99,0:35:04.46,0:35:07.54,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,but instead I went to look for the Holy Weapon for my own reasons.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:08.29,0:35:11.21,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I wanted to avenge those whose lives were taken by the Shinobi,
Dialogue: 99,0:35:11.21,0:35:13.76,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,and to avenge my mother and the people of Ise.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:14.92,0:35:16.38,Default,San,0,0,0,,Princess...
Dialogue: 99,0:35:16.38,0:35:17.39,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,On top of that,
Dialogue: 99,0:35:17.39,0:35:21.10,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I almost killed you and Suou in order to accomplish my goals.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:21.10,0:35:23.10,Default,San,0,0,0,,Princess, it's not your fault.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:23.77,0:35:26.77,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I no longer have the key, and we couldn't even cross the sandstorm.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:27.40,0:35:28.02,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Sanda,
Dialogue: 99,0:35:29.15,0:35:31.44,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,what am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 99,0:35:33.19,0:35:34.61,Default,San,0,0,0,,Princess.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:38.28,0:35:43.04,Default,San,0,0,0,,No matter what choices you make,
Dialogue: 99,0:35:43.04,0:35:44.87,Default,San,0,0,0,,I will always stand by your side.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:45.83,0:35:47.16,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:48.54,0:35:50.38,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,If I'm not determined...
Dialogue: 99,0:35:56.80,0:35:57.88,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:01.51,0:36:03.01,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 99,0:36:03.01,0:36:06.43,Default,San,0,0,0,,You have to put up with me for the time being.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:06.43,0:36:08.02,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 99,0:36:11.90,0:36:13.73,Default,San,0,0,0,,I would like challenge you to a duel.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:13.73,0:36:15.74,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Like I've said, why?
Dialogue: 99,0:36:17.24,0:36:18.78,Default,San,0,0,0,,Don't you care about the princess?
Dialogue: 99,0:36:19.95,0:36:23.33,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,No. It's just that she's kinda weird.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:24.70,0:36:26.00,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Striking without warning.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:26.58,0:36:29.62,Default,San,0,0,0,,To win a fight, you must be willing to do anything.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:29.62,0:36:31.79,Default,San,0,0,0,,This is especially true when the opponent is stronger than you.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:34.42,0:36:37.13,Default,San,0,0,0,,The Yagyuu are strong.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:37.13,0:36:40.51,Default,San,0,0,0,,They possess a strong physique and a calm heart.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:41.39,0:36:42.97,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Heart?
Dialogue: 99,0:36:42.97,0:36:44.31,Default,San,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:44.31,0:36:48.39,Default,San,0,0,0,,Fear, confusion, impatience, arrogance.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:49.27,0:36:52.02,Default,San,0,0,0,,Humans often fall victim to their own emotions,
Dialogue: 99,0:36:52.02,0:36:54.11,Default,San,0,0,0,,they become disturbed when one exploits their own weaknesses.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:54.52,0:36:57.53,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,When that happens, a human like you can't defeat me.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:02.70,0:37:05.99,Default,San,0,0,0,,As expected, you defended yourself well.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:05.99,0:37:09.16,Default,San,0,0,0,,However, if I wasn't your opponent, you'd already be dead.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:09.91,0:37:12.00,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,You're very strong.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:12.00,0:37:13.67,Default,San,0,0,0,,This is only the beginning.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:13.67,0:37:17.34,Default,San,0,0,0,,A person's real strength comes from a steady heart,
Dialogue: 99,0:37:17.34,0:37:19.72,Default,San,0,0,0,,a clear path to follow,
Dialogue: 99,0:37:19.72,0:37:21.51,Default,San,0,0,0,,an unwaivering self-confidence,
Dialogue: 99,0:37:21.51,0:37:23.39,Default,San,0,0,0,,and an unbreakable fighting spirit.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:23.39,0:37:26.06,Default,San,0,0,0,,However, I have yet to see the path that you've taken.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:30.31,0:37:32.35,Default,San,0,0,0,,You will become strong,
Dialogue: 99,0:37:32.35,0:37:34.44,Default,San,0,0,0,,or rather, you {\i1}have{\i0} to become strong.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:35.65,0:37:39.90,Default,San,0,0,0,,First, find your own heart and take hold of it.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:40.57,0:37:45.28,Default,San,0,0,0,,Only then will you be able to understand the princess' thoughts.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:47.20,0:37:47.95,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:49.16,0:37:51.33,Default,San,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:52.00,0:37:53.25,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:03.97,0:38:04.89,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:05.30,0:38:06.51,Default,San,0,0,0,,Go, Suou.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:06.51,0:38:08.81,Default,San,0,0,0,,Go and find the princess.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:29.83,0:38:32.45,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,My Lord, you wish to see me?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:32.45,0:38:33.71,Default,Tou,0,0,0,,Indeed.{doesn't he say what, although what wouldn't make sense}
Dialogue: 99,0:38:33.71,0:38:37.13,Default,Tou,0,0,0,,I heard that the Priestess of Ise is under your custody.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:37.13,0:38:38.67,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:39.30,0:38:43.55,Default,Tou,0,0,0,,Shin, I'm putting my trust in you.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:43.55,0:38:47.60,Default,Tou,0,0,0,,The blood ties in this country of war are unbreakable.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:48.30,0:38:51.43,Default,Tou,0,0,0,,Even so, you've proven to be quite skillful.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:51.43,0:38:53.18,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I am unworthy of you praise.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:53.18,0:38:54.10,Default,Tou,0,0,0,,But still,
Dialogue: 99,0:38:54.10,0:38:57.69,Default,Tou,0,0,0,,you shouldn't do things behind my back.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:57.69,0:38:59.52,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I don't think that statement is correct.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:59.94,0:39:04.99,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,A princess from a ruined country is not worthy of your attention.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:06.07,0:39:07.87,Default,Tou,0,0,0,,Do not underestimate me, Shin.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:08.28,0:39:10.95,Default,Tou,0,0,0,,My brain is not that fragile yet.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:11.49,0:39:13.95,Default,Tou,0,0,0,,The Priestess of Ise and the Holy Weapon,
Dialogue: 99,0:39:14.50,0:39:17.75,Default,Tou,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've already made the connection.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:17.75,0:39:20.63,Default,Tou,0,0,0,,Why do you think Toarai had mobilized all that money
Dialogue: 99,0:39:20.63,0:39:23.84,Default,Tou,0,0,0,,and manpower to exploring the Old Land?
Dialogue: 99,0:39:24.38,0:39:25.93,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I'm concerned.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:25.93,0:39:32.47,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I think that using the Holy Weapon, an unknown object, to control the world is a foolish act.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:32.47,0:39:36.89,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Not only will we not be able to use the Holy Weapon, but we'll make enemies out of all political powers.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:37.48,0:39:39.98,Default,Tou,0,0,0,,I'm well aware of that.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:39.98,0:39:43.19,Default,Tou,0,0,0,,Eliminating all those who defy us
Dialogue: 99,0:39:43.19,0:39:45.03,Default,Tou,0,0,0,,is the purpose of the Holy Weapon.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:45.69,0:39:49.32,Default,Tou,0,0,0,,Shin, the Holy Weapon is our only hope.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:49.82,0:39:52.91,Default,Tou,0,0,0,,Bring Ise's priestess to me.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:54.45,0:39:55.66,Default,Tou,0,0,0,,Understood?
Dialogue: 99,0:39:58.21,0:39:59.25,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:14.22,0:40:15.72,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,It's raining.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:19.14,0:40:19.90,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:20.40,0:40:21.77,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:40:23.61,0:40:24.40,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:26.49,0:40:27.57,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:33.16,0:40:34.49,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Suou?
Dialogue: 99,0:40:51.43,0:40:52.30,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,You need to dry off?
Dialogue: 99,0:40:52.68,0:40:54.22,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,No, thanks.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:54.22,0:40:55.31,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 99,0:40:55.31,0:40:58.43,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Here. This part is dry, you can use it.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:58.43,0:40:59.81,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,It's not that.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:00.27,0:41:02.77,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Suou, you're also soaking wet.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:04.40,0:41:05.15,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:08.65,0:41:09.57,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,That princess?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:10.74,0:41:12.36,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I let my guard down. I was being naive.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:12.36,0:41:13.82,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,That sly old fox.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:13.82,0:41:17.49,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I didn't think he was so obsessed with the Holy Weapon.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:17.49,0:41:18.41,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,In that case,
Dialogue: 99,0:41:18.41,0:41:21.54,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,now's the time to take control of Toarai for yourself.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:21.54,0:41:24.21,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Not yet. It's still too early.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:24.21,0:41:26.59,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,We'll have to wait until the nominations.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:26.59,0:41:27.76,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 99,0:41:27.76,0:41:28.84,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Hinata.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:28.84,0:41:30.01,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:30.01,0:41:33.68,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Do not allow the princess to make contact with my uncle.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:33.68,0:41:35.43,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,We must make our move before my uncle has a chance to.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:35.43,0:41:38.52,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Protect the princess and escape from Toarai.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:38.52,0:41:39.39,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:41.56,0:41:42.69,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:43.52,0:41:45.73,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,You must've been looking for me.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:45.73,0:41:48.36,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Yeah, Sanda told me to.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:49.03,0:41:50.15,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:52.28,0:41:54.62,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I'm really hopeless.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:55.41,0:41:57.53,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Making everyone worry all the time.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:58.29,0:42:00.62,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I understand,
Dialogue: 99,0:42:00.62,0:42:04.75,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,but that also means that everyone needs you.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:04.75,0:42:08.21,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,That's only because I'm the Princess of Ise.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:08.21,0:42:11.72,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,As a priestess, I've focused solely upon the Holy Weapon.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:12.55,0:42:15.84,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,They believed in me and followed me here.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:16.35,0:42:17.89,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 99,0:42:20.18,0:42:22.52,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Isn't it because they like you?
Dialogue: 99,0:42:24.44,0:42:26.73,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,No, you're wrong.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:26.73,0:42:29.36,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything for anyone.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:29.36,0:42:31.28,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:32.07,0:42:36.16,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,If I give up on the Holy Weapon,
Dialogue: 99,0:42:36.45,0:42:40.20,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I've accomplished nothing.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:47.46,0:42:48.75,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,You're shivering.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:49.29,0:42:52.05,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Here, now you'll be a little warmer.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:53.76,0:42:54.76,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Idiot.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:55.63,0:42:56.68,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:57.68,0:42:58.43,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,It's not that.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:01.93,0:43:05.48,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I'm happy as long as you smile.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:07.35,0:43:11.40,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Like when you looked into my eyes and praised them.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:12.15,0:43:13.28,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Suou...
Dialogue: 99,0:43:13.69,0:43:19.78,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Even if you give up on the Holy Weapon,\N you'll still be yourself.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:19.78,0:43:24.79,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,And I've decided that I'll always stand by your side.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:30.54,0:43:31.67,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Suou,
Dialogue: 99,0:43:33.09,0:43:34.21,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I…
Dialogue: 99,0:43:51.23,0:43:53.53,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,The aurora is fading.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:55.32,0:43:57.11,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Just as I thought, this is definitely...
Dialogue: 99,0:43:59.07,0:44:01.45,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,The rain has stopped.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:01.45,0:44:02.41,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:17.22,0:44:19.51,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Wait, Suou!
Dialogue: 99,0:44:24.22,0:44:27.35,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Suou, this is dangerous!
Dialogue: 99,0:44:27.35,0:44:27.85,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 99,0:44:28.48,0:44:30.27,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Stop, Suou!
Dialogue: 99,0:44:30.27,0:44:32.94,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Please stop, Suou!
Dialogue: 99,0:44:39.07,0:44:40.91,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 99,0:44:48.04,0:44:49.21,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:16.61,0:45:18.57,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Suou, are you okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:45:21.53,0:45:23.03,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I slipped a little.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:25.28,0:45:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez...
Dialogue: 99,0:45:26.66,0:45:28.12,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,You're crazy, you know?
Dialogue: 99,0:45:29.16,0:45:30.41,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:35.71,0:45:37.96,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,And you said I'm the strange one.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:38.67,0:45:40.13,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:41.30,0:45:44.47,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I like you when you're laughing.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:47.18,0:45:48.39,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Suou,
Dialogue: 99,0:45:48.39,0:45:52.64,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I'm not going to give up on the Holy Weapon.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:52.64,0:45:55.94,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I'll talk to him one more time.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:58.07,0:46:00.15,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,That “Shin” guy?
Dialogue: 99,0:46:00.61,0:46:03.66,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Yes, and I'll definitely get the key back.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:03.66,0:46:05.53,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I'll go with you this time.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:05.53,0:46:07.16,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,No, this is my—
Dialogue: 99,0:46:07.16,0:46:10.12,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Aren't you the Princess of Ise?
Dialogue: 99,0:46:10.12,0:46:11.12,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,And what if I am?
Dialogue: 99,0:46:11.12,0:46:15.08,Default,Man,0,0,0,,I'll have to detain you.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:15.08,0:46:16.04,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Detain?
Dialogue: 99,0:46:16.04,0:46:19.13,Default,Man,0,0,0,,It is a direct order from His Majesty, Tougi.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:19.13,0:46:21.09,Default,Man,0,0,0,,So, if you interfere, you'll face serious charges.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:21.72,0:46:23.38,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I will not obey any order regardless of who it's from,
Dialogue: 99,0:46:23.38,0:46:25.59,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,unless there's a reasonable cause.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:25.59,0:46:26.85,Default,Man,0,0,0,,A cause?
Dialogue: 99,0:46:26.85,0:46:28.68,Default,Man,0,0,0,,His Majesty, Tougi, wishes it .
Dialogue: 99,0:46:28.68,0:46:29.97,Default,Man,0,0,0,,That's all we need.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:32.23,0:46:33.85,Default,Man,0,0,0,,There's no use resisting.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:33.85,0:46:36.65,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Come quietly with me, shall we?
Dialogue: 99,0:46:40.61,0:46:41.40,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Hey, you.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:41.78,0:46:42.57,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Suou.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:42.57,0:46:43.82,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Nobody move.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:43.82,0:46:45.57,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,If you move, I'll kill him.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:45.57,0:46:47.74,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Do-Don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:49.28,0:46:50.45,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:51.66,0:46:53.12,Alternative,Sol,0,0,0,,Hinata-sama.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:53.12,0:46:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hinata-sama.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:54.62,0:46:56.17,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 99,0:46:56.17,0:46:58.04,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,Please forgive our rudeness.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:58.04,0:46:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's nothing...
Dialogue: 99,0:46:59.88,0:47:03.92,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,There is no excuse for your disrespectable behavior toward a princess from another country.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:05.01,0:47:07.97,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are? You're just a choirboy and a henchman.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:07.97,0:47:08.72,Default,Man,0,0,0,,I have a direct order from His Majes—
Dialogue: 99,0:47:08.72,0:47:10.01,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:10.60,0:47:13.31,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,Can you please return his sword?
Dialogue: 99,0:47:13.31,0:47:17.52,Default,Hin,30,30,0,,I, Hashiba Hinata, will take full responsibility of their actions and ensure they receive a proper punishment.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:21.40,0:47:22.94,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Why me?
Dialogue: 99,0:47:23.61,0:47:26.99,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,Tougi-sama wants to bring the Holy Weapon to Toarai
Dialogue: 99,0:47:26.99,0:47:30.16,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,by using your power as a Priestess of Ise.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:30.16,0:47:33.04,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,As you may know, Shin-sama doesn't want that to happen.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:33.45,0:47:35.96,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,Please leave Toarai as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:35.96,0:47:38.46,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,It's in your best interest as well.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:39.58,0:47:42.00,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Hinata-dono, where is Shin-sama?
Dialogue: 99,0:47:44.42,0:47:46.09,Default,Kag,0,0,0,,Everyone in the front lines,
Dialogue: 99,0:47:46.09,0:47:48.55,Default,Kag,0,0,0,,don't get tricked by their moves.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:48.55,0:47:50.26,Default,Kag,0,0,0,,The Munazashi are getting desperate.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:50.26,0:47:52.22,Default,Kag,0,0,0,,You never know what they're going to do.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:52.22,0:47:54.10,Default,Kag,0,0,0,,But make sure you don't break formation.{Maybe "Although don't force yourselves,"}
Dialogue: 99,0:47:54.10,0:47:56.52,Default,Kag,0,0,0,,At the earliest, Shin-sama's unit will arrive sometime tomorrow.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:56.52,0:47:58.65,Default,Kat,0,0,0,,Maintain the front lines.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:58.65,0:47:59.90,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Kagato-sama.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:59.90,0:48:01.94,Default,Kag,0,0,0,,What is it? You're shouting so loudly.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:01.94,0:48:04.86,Default,Kag,0,0,0,,Did Munazashi happen to move the castle?
Dialogue: 99,0:48:04.86,0:48:06.40,Default,Man,0,0,0,,No, but...
Dialogue: 99,0:48:06.40,0:48:07.61,Default,Kag,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:07.61,0:48:10.07,Default,Kag,0,0,0,,It's such a hassle to move the castle.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:12.16,0:48:14.70,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Wh-What the hell is that?!
Dialogue: 99,0:48:16.54,0:48:20.04,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,Shin-sama will be heading to the invasion of the Munazashi.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:20.79,0:48:22.63,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,He'll be leaving the castle before the sunset.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:23.34,0:48:25.96,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,Toarai is not a single structure,
Dialogue: 99,0:48:25.96,0:48:27.97,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,so please be careful on your way.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:27.97,0:48:31.47,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,I hope your way will not be closed by the dark chaos.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:32.93,0:48:34.06,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,Come on,
Dialogue: 99,0:48:34.06,0:48:36.18,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,you cockroaches that can't even come out under the light of day.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:37.48,0:48:39.19,Default,San,0,0,0,,Spit it out.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:39.19,0:48:42.40,Default,San,0,0,0,,Why are you here? Who sent you?
Dialogue: 99,0:48:46.11,0:48:46.99,Default,Han,0,0,0,,Sanda.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:48.53,0:48:50.16,Default,San,0,0,0,,You all returned?
Dialogue: 99,0:48:50.16,0:48:51.57,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 99,0:48:51.57,0:48:56.20,Default,San,0,0,0,,Oh, he was spying on us, so I was trying to find out what he was looking for,
Dialogue: 99,0:48:56.20,0:48:57.91,Default,San,0,0,0,,but he killed himself.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:58.71,0:48:59.83,Default,Han,0,0,0,,To keep his mouth shout.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:59.83,0:49:01.08,Default,San,0,0,0,,The shadow of Toarai.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:01.08,0:49:03.13,Default,San,0,0,0,,I heard a rumor
Dialogue: 99,0:49:03.13,0:49:05.67,Default,San,0,0,0,,that there's a secret unit that does anything
Dialogue: 99,0:49:05.67,0:49:09.63,Default,San,0,0,0,,and everything in order to keep the Toarai king in power.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:10.30,0:49:12.01,Default,San,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 99,0:49:13.01,0:49:14.14,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Sanda.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:14.76,0:49:16.64,Default,San,0,0,0,,Princess, I'm glad you're all right.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:29.49,0:49:30.53,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,There he is.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:31.11,0:49:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Suou!
Dialogue: 99,0:49:42.08,0:49:44.54,Default,Shin,0,0,0,,Hey, what to you want?
Dialogue: 99,0:49:44.54,0:49:45.67,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:50.67,0:49:53.64,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I would like my key back after all.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:53.68,0:49:55.30,Alternative,Sol,0,0,0,,You bastards!
Dialogue: 99,0:49:54.51,0:49:56.14,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Don't touch them.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:56.56,0:49:58.85,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,They're my guests.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:03.77,0:50:05.15,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,It's the first time.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:05.15,0:50:07.94,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,This is the first time in my life
Dialogue: 99,0:50:07.94,0:50:11.07,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,that I regret a decision I made.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:11.65,0:50:14.74,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have spared your life.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:15.07,0:50:16.58,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Please listen to me.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:16.58,0:50:17.99,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I told you
Dialogue: 99,0:50:17.99,0:50:20.41,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,that if you don't give up on the Holy Weapon,
Dialogue: 99,0:50:20.41,0:50:24.08,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I can't guarantee the lives of you and of your companions.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:24.67,0:50:26.04,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,There's no use.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:26.04,0:50:28.55,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,You can't make me change my mind.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:28.96,0:50:32.01,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,In the past, I hated Toarai.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:32.88,0:50:34.55,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I was told that it was a country of barbarians
Dialogue: 99,0:50:34.55,0:50:38.35,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,which had been expanding its territories through military force
Dialogue: 99,0:50:38.35,0:50:40.06,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,without any regards to its image.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:41.60,0:50:42.27,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 99,0:50:42.73,0:50:45.98,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,the people of Toarai are very energetic and lively.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:45.98,0:50:48.94,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Both adults and children are full of smiles and laughter.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:49.40,0:50:53.53,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,They seem to be happier than in any other country I've seen.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:58.28,0:51:03.62,Default,Ame,30,30,0,,I'm certain it's because what you're trying to accomplish is moving forward on the right path.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:04.16,0:51:09.17,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,You may even be able to create a world where humans would be able to defeat the Shinobi.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:10.63,0:51:11.80,Default,Shin,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 99,0:51:12.30,0:51:15.30,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Still, I won't give up on the Holy Weapon.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:15.84,0:51:18.93,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I was able to see which way Toarai was going
Dialogue: 99,0:51:18.93,0:51:21.68,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,because I came here and talked to you directly.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:22.31,0:51:24.27,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I wanted to find out firsthand
Dialogue: 99,0:51:24.27,0:51:28.36,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,if the Holy Weapon is truly a threat to the future of humanity
Dialogue: 99,0:51:28.36,0:51:29.73,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,like you claim.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:30.69,0:51:35.40,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,That is the road I must take as the Priestess of Ise.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:35.40,0:51:37.99,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Please believe in the hope our ancestors created for us,
Dialogue: 99,0:51:37.99,0:51:41.28,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,and allow me fulfill the duty I inherited.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:44.04,0:51:44.95,Default,Shin,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:47.83,0:51:50.75,Default,Shin,0,0,0,,If you're that determined,
Dialogue: 99,0:51:50.75,0:51:52.63,Default,Shin,0,0,0,,kill me and steal it from me.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:53.34,0:51:54.63,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:57.63,0:51:58.64,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Suou.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:58.64,0:51:59.84,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I can tell by the look in your eyes
Dialogue: 99,0:52:00.35,0:52:02.72,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,that you're willing to kill Ame.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:04.27,0:52:05.18,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:05.18,0:52:08.14,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,No matter how good of an idea it was upon its creation,
Dialogue: 99,0:52:08.14,0:52:11.44,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,in the end, it'll still become a tool for destruction.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:11.44,0:52:13.90,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,That is the history that mankind has repeated countless times.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:15.78,0:52:18.36,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I cannot allow you to reawaken the Holy Weapon.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:19.32,0:52:23.33,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,The road you believe, and the road Ame believes are...
Dialogue: 99,0:52:33.00,0:52:35.42,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,You... You're a Yagyuu, aren't you?
Dialogue: 99,0:52:36.26,0:52:37.88,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 99,0:52:37.88,0:52:40.64,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,You're worthy opponent.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:46.56,0:52:47.43,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,How exciting.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:51.48,0:52:52.19,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Suou.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:52.19,0:52:55.53,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,You're powerful and fast.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:55.53,0:52:57.69,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,But you don't know how to use a sword.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:58.28,0:53:00.03,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,You're strong.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:00.57,0:53:03.91,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I thought I knew how much, but this is beyond my expectations.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:03.91,0:53:06.20,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,But I'm still not going to lose.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:06.20,0:53:08.66,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I can't let you block the path that Ame has chosen.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:09.46,0:53:10.37,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Suou.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:10.37,0:53:12.17,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,That's a good will.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:12.17,0:53:16.05,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,You're worthy of being killed by this sword.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:41.74,0:53:42.66,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:42.91,0:53:43.78,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Suou!
Dialogue: 99,0:53:46.87,0:53:47.74,Default,San,0,0,0,,Suou.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:49.79,0:53:53.79,Default,San,0,0,0,,That man is strong; however, losing is not an option.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:54.21,0:53:56.21,Default,San,0,0,0,,You can do it.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:56.21,0:53:58.25,Default,San,0,0,0,,Take care of the princess.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:00.42,0:54:02.72,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Whatever I have to do.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:06.60,0:54:08.14,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:08.93,0:54:12.31,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,So this is the true power of the Yagyuu.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:17.44,0:54:17.98,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Suou.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:19.36,0:54:21.36,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I'm okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:23.11,0:54:24.91,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,There's so much blood. You should be treated now.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:24.91,0:54:27.24,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Don't come near me. This battle is not over yet.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:27.66,0:54:29.04,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Don't be foolish.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:29.54,0:54:33.00,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,It's not fair that one of us has to die.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:34.67,0:54:37.17,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Well, death is the only cure for fools.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:37.17,0:54:38.96,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,What on earth are you talking about?
Dialogue: 99,0:54:39.42,0:54:42.01,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,You're an indispensable person for Toarai, no—
Dialogue: 99,0:54:42.01,0:54:44.18,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,for the future of the whole world.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:44.80,0:54:49.47,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Do you know how many people would suffer if you died?
Dialogue: 99,0:54:50.10,0:54:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:51.18,0:54:53.56,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I should've killed you.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:53.56,0:54:54.77,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I didn't think I would be—
Dialogue: 99,0:54:54.77,0:54:55.65,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,Shin-sama!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:56.35,0:54:57.36,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 99,0:54:57.36,0:54:58.61,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,An enemy attack.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:00.82,0:55:01.90,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,The Shinobi?
Dialogue: 99,0:55:29.76,0:55:32.22,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,That family crest. It can't be...
Dialogue: 99,0:55:32.64,0:55:33.56,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:34.48,0:55:36.56,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,We've received reports about it from the ill-fated Kagato unit.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:37.44,0:55:39.77,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,There is no mistake that Ise Castle has moved.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:40.40,0:55:43.28,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,People, Shields, and even villages were melted by the Shinobi's toxin
Dialogue: 99,0:55:43.28,0:55:45.74,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,that were in the path of the castle,
Dialogue: 99,0:55:45.74,0:55:47.74,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,and absolutely nothing was left in its wake.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:47.74,0:55:50.95,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,But who is controlling the castle?
Dialogue: 99,0:55:50.95,0:55:54.08,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,There is no way the Shinobi can take over it.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:54.70,0:55:55.91,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:55.91,0:55:59.33,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,My parents are the only ones who could control the castle.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:59.33,0:56:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{missing: demo}{Although}{Editor: Omitted the line since it's unnecessary and minor}Still...
Dialogue: 99,0:56:00.00,0:56:04.01,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,My father passed away when I was young and my mother was...
Dialogue: 99,0:56:24.44,0:56:27.78,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Do not resist, Toarai.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:30.74,0:56:31.87,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Tsukiyomi?
Dialogue: 99,0:56:35.58,0:56:39.29,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,But you were killed when the castle fell.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:42.04,0:56:44.09,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,I was integrated into it.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:51.39,0:56:56.27,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,I've become one with the Shinobi's perpetual life force.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:00.77,0:57:02.98,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,It's been a long time,
Dialogue: 99,0:57:03.44,0:57:04.77,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Ame-sama.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:05.53,0:57:09.99,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,I've been watching you through the eyes of the Shinobi.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:09.99,0:57:12.24,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,First, I have to thank you.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:12.78,0:57:16.24,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Because of you all giving up on the castle,
Dialogue: 99,0:57:16.24,0:57:19.54,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,I was able to gather all the Shinobi from the Old Land.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:20.42,0:57:24.50,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,I will finally be able to accomplish my mission.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:24.92,0:57:28.80,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,The mission to exterminate the poison called humans from this world.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:29.92,0:57:32.43,Default,Ami,0,0,0,,Tsukiyomi, why?
Dialogue: 99,0:57:32.80,0:57:35.14,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,To exterminate humans?
Dialogue: 99,0:57:35.89,0:57:38.52,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,What the heck is he talking about?
Dialogue: 99,0:57:38.52,0:57:40.81,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,But before that,
Dialogue: 99,0:57:40.81,0:57:44.98,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,we are going to become the primordial absolute-power bearers.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:44.98,0:57:48.23,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Shall we go together, Princess?
Dialogue: 99,0:57:48.23,0:57:51.45,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Stop being a foolish and imperfect human,
Dialogue: 99,0:57:51.45,0:57:53.66,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,and evolve into the ultimate form of life:
Dialogue: 99,0:57:53.66,0:57:56.20,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,a life without hunger, sickness, or aging.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:56.20,0:57:57.58,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 99,0:57:57.58,0:58:00.75,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,How? How can you say that?
Dialogue: 99,0:58:00.75,0:58:03.33,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Didn't you hate the Shinobi?
Dialogue: 99,0:58:04.13,0:58:05.63,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,I'm disappointed.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:05.63,0:58:08.63,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,I thought you would understand.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:09.34,0:58:11.38,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,I guess I have no other choice.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:11.38,0:58:14.68,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Please give me the key for the Holy Weapon, Princess.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:15.85,0:58:17.18,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I don't have it.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:17.18,0:58:20.35,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I wouldn't give it to you even if I had it.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:21.31,0:58:23.10,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,You're giving me a hard time.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:25.27,0:58:26.06,Default,Su,0,0,0,,Ame.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:26.06,0:58:27.48,Default,Su,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 99,0:58:28.36,0:58:30.28,Default,Su,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 99,0:58:30.28,0:58:34.66,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,The Holy Weapon{Shinsyou} is simply a toy that humans created.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:34.66,0:58:36.32,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Even if it does awaken,
Dialogue: 99,0:58:36.32,0:58:41.16,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,it's powerless before the Shinobi army that I'm controlling.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:42.62,0:58:45.42,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Stop it. I have the key.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:50.30,0:58:51.55,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Such a fragile...
Dialogue: 99,0:58:55.13,0:58:56.30,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:59:03.77,0:59:04.60,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 99,0:59:05.73,0:59:06.65,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Suou.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:16.66,0:59:18.03,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:21.29,0:59:22.87,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,I see. You're a Yagyuu.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:46.60,0:59:47.69,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Ame.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:48.73,0:59:50.57,Default,Han,0,0,0,,Oh, you're up. I'm glad.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:50.57,0:59:51.15,Default,Yuz,0,0,0,,Are you awake?
Dialogue: 99,0:59:51.69,0:59:53.23,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 99,0:59:53.23,0:59:54.94,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Toarai's medical room.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:54.94,0:59:55.99,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Where is Ame?
Dialogue: 99,0:59:56.82,0:59:58.49,Default,Yuz,0,0,0,,We were all left behind.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:58.49,0:59:59.95,Default,Han,0,0,0,,Yuzu.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:59.95,1:00:02.83,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,She's heading to the Old Land with Sanda.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:02.83,1:00:04.58,Default,Eri,0,0,0,,To look for the Holy Weapon.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:04.58,1:00:05.62,Default,Han,0,0,0,,All of you...
Dialogue: 99,1:00:05.62,1:00:07.50,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,He'll soon find out.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:08.92,1:00:09.79,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I have to go.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:09.79,1:00:11.96,Default,Han,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't push yourself!
Dialogue: 99,1:00:16.59,1:00:17.93,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Suou, please calm down.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:18.76,1:00:20.43,Default,Han,0,0,0,,You don't remember?
Dialogue: 99,1:00:20.43,1:00:25.89,Default,Han,0,0,0,,We were able to defeat all of the Shinobi Tsukiyomi sent because of you.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:26.48,1:00:29.35,Default,Han,0,0,0,,We were bit surprised...
Dialogue: 99,1:00:39.16,1:00:42.07,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:56.30,1:01:00.43,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,We are going to move the Toarai Castle to fight with the Ise Castle.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:59.88,1:01:00.76,Alternative,Sol,0,0,0,,Say that again?
Dialogue: 99,1:01:00.76,1:01:02.30,Alternative,Sol,0,0,0,,There's no way we can win.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:01.84,1:01:03.01,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Quiet.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:04.01,1:01:08.94,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Ise Castle halted its attack on Toarai and is heading toward the Old Land.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:08.94,1:01:11.27,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Its target is believed to be the Holy Weapon.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:11.27,1:01:15.78,Default,Shi,30,30,0,,Considering that both the Ise Castle and Ame-dono, the Priestess of Ise, are heading toward the Old Land,
Dialogue: 99,1:01:15.78,1:01:18.07,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,and that she has the key to the Holy Weapon back now,
Dialogue: 99,1:01:18.07,1:01:19.57,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,there is no mistake.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:19.57,1:01:22.87,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,We will be attacking Ise Castle from behind.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:22.87,1:01:26.87,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,We'll be buying time for Ame-dono until she reaches the Holy Weapon.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:26.87,1:01:28.83,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,This isn't any ordinary battle.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:28.83,1:01:30.33,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,The future of Toarai, no—
Dialogue: 99,1:01:30.33,1:01:32.46,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,the future of the entire world depends of the outcome of this battle.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:32.96,1:01:36.17,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,This battle will prove that the road we, Toarai, take—
Dialogue: 99,1:01:36.17,1:01:38.01,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,will be the high road for eternity.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:39.47,1:01:42.09,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I also don't like being kicked around.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:42.09,1:01:44.01,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,This time we'll be the one's attacking.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:44.01,1:01:45.85,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Everyone, prepare to move the castle.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:45.85,1:01:47.18,Default,Sol,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 99,1:01:50.60,1:01:52.73,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Look, the sandstorm is...
Dialogue: 99,1:01:53.15,1:01:56.48,Default,San,0,0,0,,That in the distance must be the Old Land.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:56.48,1:01:59.86,Default,San,0,0,0,,Looks like we won't suffer the same fate as last time.
Dialogue: 99,1:02:01.36,1:02:04.53,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Let's find the Holy Weapon.
Dialogue: 99,1:02:17.25,1:02:20.51,Default,San,0,0,0,,As I expected, I don't feel any of the effects of the beryllium.
Dialogue: 99,1:02:20.51,1:02:22.84,Default,San,0,0,0,,All sensors are working fine too.
Dialogue: 99,1:02:22.84,1:02:26.10,Default,San,0,0,0,,The path is quite winding but as long as we are heading in right direction...
Dialogue: 99,1:02:26.47,1:02:30.35,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Right, we can follow the road Suou told us about.
Dialogue: 99,1:02:33.52,1:02:37.32,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Is his name Suou? That Yagyuu's.
Dialogue: 99,1:02:38.19,1:02:38.90,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,1:02:39.40,1:02:42.03,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,If you don't mind, I would like him to, along with the girls...
Dialogue: 99,1:02:42.49,1:02:44.95,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Leave him in Toarai?
Dialogue: 99,1:02:45.87,1:02:49.24,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Tsukiyomi seems to be heading toward the Old Land.
Dialogue: 99,1:02:49.24,1:02:51.58,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,In order to possess absolute power, he said.
Dialogue: 99,1:02:52.37,1:02:55.00,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,If I don't hurry it'll be too late.
Dialogue: 99,1:02:56.96,1:03:01.67,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,The aurora that was covering the Old Land along with the sandstorm has disappeared.
Dialogue: 99,1:03:01.67,1:03:02.51,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 99,1:03:02.51,1:03:06.39,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,It seems like the change started ever since that time you've almost died
Dialogue: 99,1:03:06.39,1:03:10.14,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,trying to go reach the Old Land.
Dialogue: 99,1:03:11.14,1:03:13.73,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,That thing may have been already awakened...
Dialogue: 99,1:03:16.48,1:03:19.65,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,to accept the priestess as its master.
Dialogue: 99,1:03:21.65,1:03:23.32,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I won't interfere.
Dialogue: 99,1:03:23.74,1:03:26.20,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,You should follow the road you chose for yourself.
Dialogue: 99,1:03:38.21,1:03:39.42,Default,San,0,0,0,,Princess.
Dialogue: 99,1:03:40.96,1:03:43.59,Default,San,0,0,0,,I can see it, there, that's the Old Land.
Dialogue: 99,1:03:44.22,1:03:45.93,Default,San,0,0,0,,I'm only guessing,
Dialogue: 99,1:03:45.93,1:03:47.93,Default,San,0,0,0,,but the one in the distance is...
Dialogue: 99,1:03:48.51,1:03:49.68,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Mt. Fuji.
Dialogue: 99,1:03:51.31,1:03:52.93,Default,San,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 99,1:03:52.93,1:03:53.81,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,1:04:16.33,1:04:18.12,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,There are so many trees.
Dialogue: 99,1:04:19.71,1:04:20.84,Default,San,0,0,0,,A flower?
Dialogue: 99,1:04:21.50,1:04:22.67,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 99,1:04:25.42,1:04:28.26,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,If my mother had seen this place, I wonder what she would've said.
Dialogue: 99,1:04:28.97,1:04:30.18,Default,San,0,0,0,,Princess...
Dialogue: 99,1:04:30.85,1:04:34.14,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I didn't know the Old Land was such a rich place.
Dialogue: 99,1:04:35.10,1:04:37.56,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,The wasteland doesn't hold a candle to this.
Dialogue: 99,1:04:38.39,1:04:41.65,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,People will not suffer for hunger here.
Dialogue: 99,1:04:41.65,1:04:43.44,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,If that happens...
Dialogue: 99,1:04:44.98,1:04:45.78,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,The Shinobi!
Dialogue: 99,1:04:45.99,1:04:48.53,Default,San,0,0,0,,Princess, leave at once.
Dialogue: 99,1:04:48.53,1:04:50.99,Default,San,0,0,0,,The Shinobi will swarm here after hearing that sound.
Dialogue: 99,1:04:56.62,1:04:57.46,Default,San,0,0,0,,We should pull back.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:00.33,1:05:01.79,Default,San,0,0,0,,Princess.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:04.30,1:05:06.17,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,One. Two.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:07.42,1:05:08.01,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Huge!
Dialogue: 99,1:05:11.89,1:05:14.35,Default,San,0,0,0,,There are too many of the Shinobi.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:14.35,1:05:16.64,Default,San,0,0,0,,The worst part is that they're gigantic.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:16.64,1:05:18.14,Default,San,0,0,0,,If there are any more...
Dialogue: 99,1:05:23.31,1:05:23.94,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Sanda.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:25.40,1:05:26.61,Default,San,0,0,0,,I'm still in one piece.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:27.57,1:05:29.07,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Thank god.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:29.07,1:05:32.32,Default,San,0,0,0,,But I can't believe there are this many out here.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:32.32,1:05:35.37,Default,San,0,0,0,,The Old Land seems be to a nexus to the Shinobi.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:36.58,1:05:37.45,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Sanda,
Dialogue: 99,1:05:37.91,1:05:39.21,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,something's wrong with our radios.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:39.21,1:05:40.50,Default,San,0,0,0,,Princess...
Dialogue: 99,1:05:41.75,1:05:42.71,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Sanda.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:44.21,1:05:44.92,Default,San,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 99,1:05:45.84,1:05:46.92,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Loud and clear.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:47.63,1:05:50.01,Default,San,0,0,0,,Can you see the Fuji mountain?
Dialogue: 99,1:05:51.09,1:05:52.43,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm looking at it.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:52.43,1:05:56.39,Default,San,0,0,0,,Legend has it that the Holy Weapon is at the base of that mountain.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:57.18,1:05:57.85,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:58.60,1:06:01.02,Default,San,0,0,0,,I'll take care of the Shinobi.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:01.02,1:06:05.94,Default,San,0,0,0,,Princess, head toward the base of Mt. Fuji at full speed and don't look back.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:05.94,1:06:06.57,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 99,1:06:06.90,1:06:08.53,Default,San,0,0,0,,You don't need to worry about me.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:08.53,1:06:10.65,Default,San,0,0,0,,I'm a soldier.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:10.65,1:06:13.16,Default,San,0,0,0,,I won't fall behind that easily.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:13.49,1:06:14.45,Default,San,0,0,0,,Well, then.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:32.76,1:06:34.05,Default,San,0,0,0,,Do not look back!
Dialogue: 99,1:06:34.05,1:06:34.97,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,But!
Dialogue: 99,1:06:34.97,1:06:36.01,Default,San,0,0,0,,Straight ahead!
Dialogue: 99,1:06:37.30,1:06:38.72,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,The beam of light...
Dialogue: 99,1:06:42.48,1:06:45.52,Default,San,0,0,0,,There's no mistaking it, Ame-sama.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:45.52,1:06:48.32,Default,San,0,0,0,,That light must be the Holy Weapon.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:48.32,1:06:48.86,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Sanda!
Dialogue: 99,1:06:49.90,1:06:51.61,Default,San,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:52.44,1:06:55.07,Default,San,0,0,0,,I'll catch up with you after I take care of this.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:55.74,1:06:56.28,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,You're lying.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:56.28,1:06:58.49,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I can tell by the presence of the Shinobi.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:58.49,1:07:00.91,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,You can't fight alone.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:00.91,1:07:01.58,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I'll—
Dialogue: 99,1:07:01.58,1:07:02.66,Default,San,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:02.75,1:07:04.75,Default,San,0,0,0,,You mustn't stop, Princess.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:04.75,1:07:05.87,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Sanda...
Dialogue: 99,1:07:05.87,1:07:07.54,Default,San,0,0,0,,It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:07.54,1:07:09.92,Default,San,0,0,0,,You've become strong, Ame-sama.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:10.46,1:07:13.05,Default,San,0,0,0,,You're much stronger than you think.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:13.05,1:07:13.84,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 99,1:07:14.38,1:07:18.39,Default,San,0,0,0,,You're bearing a heavy burden.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:20.85,1:07:23.64,Default,San,0,0,0,,Everyone is waiting for you,
Dialogue: 99,1:07:27.23,1:07:29.19,Default,San,0,0,0,,so don't look back.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:30.07,1:07:34.86,Default,San,0,0,0,,Believe in the Holy Weapon and in all the people that helped you get where you are now!
Dialogue: 99,1:07:34.86,1:07:37.45,Default,San,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}Please run, Ame-sama!
Dialogue: 99,1:07:46.00,1:07:49.08,Default,San,0,0,0,,It was a brave decision, Ame-sama.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:00.55,1:08:06.39,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Sanda, I promise I will, no matter what...
Dialogue: 99,1:08:09.69,1:08:10.52,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,The light is...
Dialogue: 99,1:08:18.66,1:08:20.95,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,Sub-control, everything's ready.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:21.41,1:08:22.08,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 99,1:08:22.08,1:08:24.54,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I'll be issuing commands from here.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:24.54,1:08:26.21,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Everyone, take your positions.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:28.12,1:08:30.71,Default,Sol,0,0,0,,Evacuation of all citizens is complete.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:31.46,1:08:33.59,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Toarai, launch.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:34.17,1:08:35.09,Default,Sol,0,0,0,,Launching.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:50.81,1:08:51.69,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Ame.
Dialogue: 99,1:09:12.75,1:09:14.00,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 99,1:09:14.59,1:09:17.01,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,This is the Holy Weapon, Giga Road.
Dialogue: 99,1:09:19.13,1:09:22.30,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,To control the wind, light, and earth
Dialogue: 99,1:09:22.30,1:09:24.51,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,is within the Giga Road's capabilities.
Dialogue: 99,1:09:25.35,1:09:27.22,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,If I have this power...
Dialogue: 99,1:09:30.02,1:09:33.15,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,It's covered with debris, but there isn't even a single scratch.
Dialogue: 99,1:09:34.94,1:09:37.03,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Giga Road, wake up.
Dialogue: 99,1:09:42.87,1:09:44.99,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,You're asking me to sit, right?
Dialogue: 99,1:09:53.67,1:09:58.01,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Giga Road, tell me what to do.
Dialogue: 99,1:10:01.68,1:10:02.72,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,1:10:07.26,1:10:09.52,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,What an amazing resistance.
Dialogue: 99,1:10:09.52,1:10:11.77,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Had I not use the Ise Castle for protection,
Dialogue: 99,1:10:11.77,1:10:15.69,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have been able to break through.
Dialogue: 99,1:10:18.57,1:10:20.99,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,My, it looks like the world is about to end.
Dialogue: 99,1:10:21.70,1:10:23.20,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Tsukiyomi.
Dialogue: 99,1:10:24.16,1:10:25.32,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 99,1:10:28.16,1:10:29.12,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Is this...
Dialogue: 99,1:10:29.12,1:10:32.58,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Ame-sama, congratulations.
Dialogue: 99,1:10:32.58,1:10:36.00,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,You've finally found the long-lost Giga Road.
Dialogue: 99,1:10:38.21,1:10:41.30,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Please help me, Giga Road.
Dialogue: 99,1:10:46.64,1:10:47.43,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,You answered me.
Dialogue: 99,1:10:49.35,1:10:51.56,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Oh, it doesn't work?
Dialogue: 99,1:10:51.56,1:10:55.60,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,I was hoping to see the power of an early civilization's weapon of mass destruction.
Dialogue: 99,1:10:55.60,1:10:56.73,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,But It doesn't matter now.
Dialogue: 99,1:10:57.06,1:10:59.78,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,I'll crush you.
Dialogue: 99,1:11:00.15,1:11:01.28,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Fast,
Dialogue: 99,1:11:01.28,1:11:03.11,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,isn't there anything I can do?
Dialogue: 99,1:11:03.11,1:11:04.91,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,It is totally different from a Shield.
Dialogue: 99,1:11:08.16,1:11:10.58,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Again this? You've been showing me the same thing over and over.
Dialogue: 99,1:11:15.46,1:11:16.88,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Mother.
Dialogue: 99,1:11:19.71,1:11:20.88,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,It's moving.
Dialogue: 99,1:11:25.18,1:11:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 99,1:11:36.40,1:11:38.52,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,It ended so fast.
Dialogue: 99,1:11:38.52,1:11:40.15,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Well, I guess it's okay.
Dialogue: 99,1:11:40.15,1:11:42.28,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,The important thing was finding this place.
Dialogue: 99,1:11:42.28,1:11:46.41,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,The land of beginnings where the Holy Weapon had been sealed.
Dialogue: 99,1:11:47.03,1:11:50.16,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Looks like I'll be busy from now on.
Dialogue: 99,1:11:50.16,1:11:52.79,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,I'm going to make a new world.
Dialogue: 99,1:11:57.12,1:12:00.38,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to find this place so quickly.
Dialogue: 99,1:12:01.25,1:12:05.26,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,If I may say so myself, it was a touch of genius to let the Princess Ame go off on her own.
Dialogue: 99,1:12:05.26,1:12:06.76,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Poor princess.
Dialogue: 99,1:12:06.76,1:12:11.60,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Her father, her mother, her people, and all her servants were killed by the Shinobi.
Dialogue: 99,1:12:11.60,1:12:12.43,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Wait,
Dialogue: 99,1:12:12.43,1:12:17.19,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,they became bedrock to create the ideal world for me,
Dialogue: 99,1:12:17.19,1:12:19.10,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,so she should be happy.
Dialogue: 99,1:12:19.61,1:12:20.40,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,1:12:24.53,1:12:25.61,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Tsukiyomi,
Dialogue: 99,1:12:25.61,1:12:28.36,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,so you had everything planned out!
Dialogue: 99,1:12:28.36,1:12:29.49,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I won't forgive you!
Dialogue: 99,1:12:29.49,1:12:30.78,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Excuse me,
Dialogue: 99,1:12:30.78,1:12:33.45,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,but that wasn't for you, Princess.
Dialogue: 99,1:12:33.45,1:12:35.04,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 99,1:12:41.75,1:12:44.42,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,If you let me, I'll see how powerful you are now.
Dialogue: 99,1:12:49.59,1:12:52.30,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I can win. I can move as I wish.
Dialogue: 99,1:12:52.30,1:12:54.68,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,This is the end!
Dialogue: 99,1:12:59.52,1:13:01.48,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,My,
Dialogue: 99,1:13:01.98,1:13:06.61,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,what a disaster. You ruined these pristine forests.
Dialogue: 99,1:13:06.61,1:13:07.32,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Still,
Dialogue: 99,1:13:07.82,1:13:12.32,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,its seems a little different from the legend.
Dialogue: 99,1:13:16.79,1:13:18.41,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,If that's the case, I'll just go and crush you.
Dialogue: 99,1:13:34.89,1:13:36.56,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 99,1:13:36.56,1:13:41.48,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Good grief, your reckless behavior hasn't changed a bit since you were a child.
Dialogue: 99,1:13:41.48,1:13:43.69,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,The Giga Road is not complete yet,
Dialogue: 99,1:13:43.69,1:13:46.36,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,but you still went and use it.
Dialogue: 99,1:13:46.90,1:13:49.19,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,The Giga Road is not a god.
Dialogue: 99,1:13:49.19,1:13:52.36,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,It's simply a toy human created.
Dialogue: 99,1:13:52.36,1:13:54.20,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,It has both limits and constraints.
Dialogue: 99,1:13:54.70,1:13:56.91,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,See how you become short of breath and fatigued.
Dialogue: 99,1:13:56.91,1:13:59.50,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Don't you feel like your body is burning up?
Dialogue: 99,1:13:59.50,1:14:01.79,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,That seems to be a kind of limit control.
Dialogue: 99,1:14:01.79,1:14:07.05,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,It transfers the burden of the fuselage and the excess heat directly to the pilot
Dialogue: 99,1:14:07.05,1:14:09.97,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,in order to protect itself from getting damaged
Dialogue: 99,1:14:09.97,1:14:12.51,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,from its own tremendous power.
Dialogue: 99,1:14:12.51,1:14:14.34,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 99,1:14:14.34,1:14:17.10,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,It is such a foolish and hideous power.
Dialogue: 99,1:14:17.10,1:14:18.60,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,There is no right or wrong.
Dialogue: 99,1:14:18.60,1:14:22.27,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,If a person like you, who is controlled by hatred,
Dialogue: 99,1:14:22.27,1:14:25.48,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,uses it to knock down trees, split the land, and crush lives.
Dialogue: 99,1:14:26.02,1:14:29.28,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Humans are foolish and dumb.
Dialogue: 99,1:14:29.65,1:14:30.61,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Oh, well,
Dialogue: 99,1:14:30.94,1:14:32.70,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,that's Toarai.
Dialogue: 99,1:14:32.70,1:14:34.66,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,It's raising a white flag.
Dialogue: 99,1:14:35.20,1:14:38.33,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,The one on the watch must be the Crown Prince Shin.
Dialogue: 99,1:14:38.33,1:14:40.62,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Moving the castle to chase me all the way here,
Dialogue: 99,1:14:40.62,1:14:42.66,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,he acts quickly, as expected.
Dialogue: 99,1:14:42.66,1:14:45.17,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,All right, Strategic Maneuver Castle,
Dialogue: 99,1:14:45.17,1:14:47.29,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,we'll switch to self-activation mode.
Dialogue: 99,1:14:47.29,1:14:48.21,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Disconnect it.
Dialogue: 99,1:14:53.68,1:14:56.26,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,That is the infamous Maneuver Castle.
Dialogue: 99,1:14:56.26,1:14:59.10,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,If the Crown Prince himself is coming,
Dialogue: 99,1:14:59.10,1:15:01.85,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,I will listen to what he has to say.
Dialogue: 99,1:15:01.85,1:15:04.39,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Though in the end nothing will change.
Dialogue: 99,1:15:04.69,1:15:07.23,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll crush you and exterminate all the human race.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,1:15:08.86,1:15:11.86,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,You have no right to do that!
Dialogue: 99,1:15:11.86,1:15:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,1:15:13.86,1:15:16.24,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Everyone is struggling to survive.
Dialogue: 99,1:15:16.70,1:15:20.08,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,We destroy nature, kill each other,
Dialogue: 99,1:15:20.58,1:15:22.50,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,and take so many other lives.
Dialogue: 99,1:15:22.50,1:15:26.54,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,But still, we are all living in this world.
Dialogue: 99,1:15:27.00,1:15:31.21,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,And we've lived with suffering and have struggled for thousands of years.
Dialogue: 99,1:15:31.21,1:15:33.38,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,No, we are still living,
Dialogue: 99,1:15:33.38,1:15:35.38,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,being pushed forward by our own will.
Dialogue: 99,1:15:36.64,1:15:39.89,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I won't let someone like you toy with humankind!
Dialogue: 99,1:15:39.89,1:15:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut...
Dialogue: 99,1:15:40.81,1:15:43.10,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Shut up, little bitch!
Dialogue: 99,1:15:50.52,1:15:52.90,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,It's programmed to protect the pilot?
Dialogue: 99,1:15:52.90,1:15:54.15,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Don't make me laugh.
Dialogue: 99,1:15:54.69,1:15:57.11,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Here, let me show you something.
Dialogue: 99,1:16:00.28,1:16:01.45,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 99,1:16:01.45,1:16:04.12,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,He doesn't seem to pay attention to us at all.
Dialogue: 99,1:16:04.12,1:16:05.79,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,That's actually better for us.
Dialogue: 99,1:16:05.79,1:16:08.92,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Can you crash into that black spherical object?
Dialogue: 99,1:16:08.92,1:16:10.13,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,I'll try my best.
Dialogue: 99,1:16:10.13,1:16:14.01,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,Although I'm little worried since these controls aren't the greatest.
Dialogue: 99,1:16:14.01,1:16:16.88,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Perhaps his main purpose is that sphere.
Dialogue: 99,1:16:16.88,1:16:19.39,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Give him one good crack and make him shudder.
Dialogue: 99,1:16:19.39,1:16:20.51,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 99,1:16:20.51,1:16:23.64,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,When the target is locked, we will retreat,
Dialogue: 99,1:16:23.64,1:16:24.68,Default,Hin,0,0,0,,but what will you do? {note: talking to Suou in hiding.}
Dialogue: 99,1:16:24.68,1:16:28.15,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Come on, I don't even know when you boarded,
Dialogue: 99,1:16:30.36,1:16:32.32,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,but you're going in, aren't you?
Dialogue: 99,1:16:32.32,1:16:33.15,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,1:16:34.03,1:16:36.40,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I must thank you.
Dialogue: 99,1:16:36.40,1:16:39.87,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,If you didn't transform back then,
Dialogue: 99,1:16:39.87,1:16:41.78,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Toarai would've been annihilated.
Dialogue: 99,1:16:42.45,1:16:44.79,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Even if you only did it for the priestess.
Dialogue: 99,1:16:45.58,1:16:47.87,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,After this ship crashes into the Ise Castle
Dialogue: 99,1:16:47.87,1:16:51.04,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,it will burn up its energy reserves and self-destroy.
Dialogue: 99,1:16:51.04,1:16:53.59,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Make sure you get off before that happens.
Dialogue: 99,1:16:53.59,1:16:54.42,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 99,1:16:59.76,1:17:01.05,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Stay alive out there.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:02.89,1:17:03.56,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,All right,
Dialogue: 99,1:17:03.56,1:17:05.81,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,let's reestablish communication with the main unit.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:06.43,1:17:10.52,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Can you see this divine Jet Matrix?
Dialogue: 99,1:17:10.52,1:17:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 99,1:17:11.23,1:17:13.23,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,This is my earnest desire,
Dialogue: 99,1:17:13.23,1:17:19.20,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,and the only hope that will cleanse the world of the filthy sludge called humans.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:20.24,1:17:22.32,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,I'm the one chosen by God.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:22.32,1:17:25.20,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Because I researched the cells of the Shinobi extensively,
Dialogue: 99,1:17:25.20,1:17:29.29,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,it must be fate—a miracle\N that I have obtained this body.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:29.29,1:17:34.21,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,This eternal body possesses the Shinobi's superior ability.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:37.09,1:17:40.09,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Absolute regenerative ability.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:40.63,1:17:43.55,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Complete control over cell changes.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:43.55,1:17:46.39,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,The power to integrate with any other solid substance.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:46.39,1:17:50.10,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Sharing and controlling the thoughts of distant objects.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:50.56,1:17:52.19,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,The sharing of vision.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:52.98,1:17:57.94,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,The power given to me by God provides me a wealth of information.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:57.94,1:17:59.95,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Not only the status of Kairiku,
Dialogue: 99,1:17:59.95,1:18:03.74,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,but also state of the Old Land and the history of early civilization, where humans can't even enter.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:03.74,1:18:07.66,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Then when I finally reached the dark truth that has been hidden for so long,
Dialogue: 99,1:18:08.37,1:18:10.91,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,I realized how foolish human nature is.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:13.58,1:18:18.17,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,I personally exposed the Jet Matrix.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:18.17,1:18:21.47,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,It fuels on the energy created by the misdeeds of humans
Dialogue: 99,1:18:21.47,1:18:24.43,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,that lead to the destruction of the world.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:24.97,1:18:28.93,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Ame-sama, the truth is the Shinobi can't breed.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:28.93,1:18:31.31,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,If the core is destroyed, they'll never return.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:32.06,1:18:35.73,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,If we leave them be, they'll eventually die off completely.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:36.31,1:18:41.19,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,But this Jet Matrix is like the Shinobi's mother.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:41.19,1:18:45.24,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,It can create Shinobi cores and breed them endlessly.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:45.99,1:18:52.04,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Humans have foolishly tried to eliminate this Jet Matrix countless times...
Dialogue: 99,1:18:52.04,1:18:55.50,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,but this incredible mass of\N life energy could not be destroyed.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:55.50,1:19:00.13,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Even the early civilization's final weapon, the Giga Road, was unable to destroy it.
Dialogue: 99,1:19:00.13,1:19:01.59,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,You're a stupid woman.
Dialogue: 99,1:19:02.09,1:19:04.84,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,The Giga Road was not being sealed off.
Dialogue: 99,1:19:04.84,1:19:08.43,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,It was sealing the Jet Matrix along with the facility...
Dialogue: 99,1:19:08.43,1:19:12.60,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,within the Old Land to seal away its power to manipulate and move objects.
Dialogue: 99,1:19:14.19,1:19:15.56,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Thanks to you,
Dialogue: 99,1:19:15.56,1:19:19.02,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,all of the effort that early civilization spent sealing the Jet Matrix have gone down the drain.
Dialogue: 99,1:19:19.02,1:19:20.07,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Isn't it wonderful?
Dialogue: 99,1:19:20.57,1:19:23.45,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,The preparation of the new world has already started.
Dialogue: 99,1:19:23.45,1:19:25.32,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,While you found the Giga Road
Dialogue: 99,1:19:25.32,1:19:28.83,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,and destroyed the land and trees of the Old Land in your rage,
Dialogue: 99,1:19:28.83,1:19:32.54,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,motivated by a profound need for revenge.
Dialogue: 99,1:19:37.00,1:19:40.84,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,However, people will be reborn as a result of those sacrifices.
Dialogue: 99,1:19:40.84,1:19:46.51,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,And you'll have a front row seat. The true purification is for you...
Dialogue: 99,1:19:46.51,1:19:48.97,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,who couldn't let go of the human world—
Dialogue: 99,1:19:50.47,1:19:53.22,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,You're that Yagyuu.
Dialogue: 99,1:19:58.77,1:19:59.90,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,The Matrix is..
Dialogue: 99,1:20:00.36,1:20:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad!{Why? }
Dialogue: 99,1:20:01.36,1:20:02.69,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,The cores are exploding!
Dialogue: 99,1:20:11.70,1:20:14.66,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,That bastard looks like he's starting to lose his cool.
Dialogue: 99,1:20:15.25,1:20:17.00,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I'll leave the rest to you.
Dialogue: 99,1:20:17.71,1:20:18.46,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Ame!
Dialogue: 99,1:20:20.88,1:20:22.34,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Ame!
Dialogue: 99,1:20:26.30,1:20:27.18,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Ame.
Dialogue: 99,1:20:27.84,1:20:29.01,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Ame!
Dialogue: 99,1:20:30.14,1:20:32.81,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Suou, why are you here?
Dialogue: 99,1:20:33.68,1:20:36.64,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I was worried since only Sanda was with you.
Dialogue: 99,1:20:39.56,1:20:42.82,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Sanda is dead.
Dialogue: 99,1:20:46.86,1:20:48.15,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 99,1:20:48.49,1:20:51.32,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I'm an idiot.
Dialogue: 99,1:20:51.32,1:20:54.58,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I was bragging that I was the only one who could do it.
Dialogue: 99,1:20:54.58,1:20:57.25,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I... The Giga Road won't move any more.
Dialogue: 99,1:20:57.25,1:20:59.33,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,How can I call myself the Priestess of Ise
Dialogue: 99,1:20:59.87,1:21:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I... Why?
Dialogue: 99,1:21:02.38,1:21:03.00,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 99,1:21:04.00,1:21:06.21,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Tsukiyomi was laughing at me.
Dialogue: 99,1:21:06.21,1:21:09.38,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,He was able to create even more of the Shinobi thanks to me.
Dialogue: 99,1:21:09.51,1:21:13.14,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Suou, Sanda died because of me.
Dialogue: 99,1:21:13.14,1:21:15.85,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Mother died protecting me.
Dialogue: 99,1:21:15.85,1:21:18.35,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Toarai was attacked because of me.
Dialogue: 99,1:21:18.35,1:21:20.94,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 99,1:21:22.06,1:21:25.61,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Suou, I shouldn't have been the Priestess of Ise
Dialogue: 99,1:21:25.61,1:21:28.78,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,If I weren't a priestess, all these terrible things wouldn't have happened.
Dialogue: 99,1:21:29.36,1:21:32.28,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I wish I weren't born.
Dialogue: 99,1:21:33.16,1:21:34.20,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Ame...
Dialogue: 99,1:21:38.04,1:21:43.38,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,People feared the power of the Yagyuu and I was alone because of that.
Dialogue: 99,1:21:44.29,1:21:46.00,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Even when people threw stones at me,
Dialogue: 99,1:21:46.00,1:21:49.76,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I didn't have anything to say.
Dialogue: 99,1:21:49.76,1:21:51.01,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,No, don't come near me!
Dialogue: 99,1:21:52.84,1:21:58.06,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I've always felt miserable, so I came to accept being alone,
Dialogue: 99,1:21:58.06,1:21:58.56,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,but...
Dialogue: 99,1:21:58.56,1:21:59.89,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Suou,
Dialogue: 99,1:21:59.89,1:22:02.69,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,you can't stay here.
Dialogue: 99,1:22:02.69,1:22:06.36,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,The Giga Road will try to protect me, so...
Dialogue: 99,1:22:06.36,1:22:10.53,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I don't know how to say this, but, for the first time,
Dialogue: 99,1:22:10.53,1:22:12.28,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,even if it was a short time,
Dialogue: 99,1:22:12.28,1:22:15.45,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I've had fun with Ame and the others...
Dialogue: 99,1:22:16.20,1:22:19.54,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Stop it, Giga Road, stop!
Dialogue: 99,1:22:20.58,1:22:25.50,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I always wanted to be by your side.
Dialogue: 99,1:22:25.88,1:22:27.84,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Not being able to see you any more....
Dialogue: 99,1:22:27.84,1:22:29.09,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 99,1:22:32.09,1:22:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want that...
Dialogue: 99,1:22:33.38,1:22:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 99,1:22:36.55,1:22:37.81,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Suou...
Dialogue: 99,1:22:38.85,1:22:40.10,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Ame.
Dialogue: 99,1:22:40.10,1:22:40.81,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Suou!
Dialogue: 99,1:22:43.02,1:22:45.98,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Suou! Suou!
Dialogue: 99,1:22:45.98,1:22:46.98,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I'm all right.
Dialogue: 99,1:22:47.90,1:22:51.32,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I'm strong, and you know that.
Dialogue: 99,1:22:52.45,1:22:55.66,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I will never leave you, Ame.
Dialogue: 99,1:22:56.20,1:22:58.83,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I'll be with you no matter what happens.
Dialogue: 99,1:22:59.83,1:23:03.79,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,I'm so happy that I met you.
Dialogue: 99,1:23:07.25,1:23:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,1:23:25.27,1:23:27.73,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Is that all, even from Toarai?
Dialogue: 99,1:23:27.73,1:23:33.78,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,I've lost the Ise Castle but the Jet Matrix is still in perfect condition.
Dialogue: 99,1:23:35.32,1:23:36.70,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,It's awakened.
Dialogue: 99,1:23:36.70,1:23:40.45,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,That blazing suit, the Holy Weapon Giga Road.
Dialogue: 99,1:23:43.33,1:23:44.08,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,This can't be true.
Dialogue: 99,1:23:46.25,1:23:46.96,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 99,1:23:50.67,1:23:53.80,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,I-I told you it's pointless.
Dialogue: 99,1:23:54.67,1:23:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 99,1:23:56.01,1:23:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate...
Dialogue: 99,1:23:57.55,1:24:01.31,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,How is the Giga Road so powerful?
Dialogue: 99,1:24:01.31,1:24:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 99,1:24:03.35,1:24:05.06,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,What on earth happened?
Dialogue: 99,1:24:08.98,1:24:13.65,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,I don't know how she did it but that energy is raging out of control.
Dialogue: 99,1:24:13.65,1:24:14.99,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Fool!
Dialogue: 99,1:24:14.99,1:24:16.40,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,If you let go, you'll die.
Dialogue: 99,1:24:17.20,1:24:19.91,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,If you want to die, go do it on your own!
Dialogue: 99,1:24:19.91,1:24:21.87,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,What an ignorant destructionalist.
Dialogue: 99,1:24:29.92,1:24:32.09,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,I made it. I won.
Dialogue: 99,1:24:37.38,1:24:38.89,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Suou...
Dialogue: 99,1:24:39.59,1:24:44.68,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Suou, I can feel you inside of me.
Dialogue: 99,1:24:44.68,1:24:48.02,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Your heartbeat gives me power.
Dialogue: 99,1:24:49.56,1:24:52.44,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Let's finish this, together.
Dialogue: 99,1:24:55.44,1:24:57.95,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Behold this divine figure—
Dialogue: 99,1:24:57.95,1:25:01.45,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,the overwhelming power of all the Shinobi from the Old Land.
Dialogue: 99,1:25:01.82,1:25:06.45,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,How long can you last against this many Shinobi?
Dialogue: 99,1:25:20.09,1:25:21.05,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,So weak.
Dialogue: 99,1:25:22.26,1:25:23.76,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Ame, target the core.
Dialogue: 99,1:25:23.76,1:25:26.52,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Just like the Shinobi it creates, it too has a core.
Dialogue: 99,1:25:26.52,1:25:28.77,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,That sickly reddish gleam, it's the same as the Shinobi's.
Dialogue: 99,1:25:29.27,1:25:30.27,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,That will be.
Dialogue: 99,1:25:31.23,1:25:34.86,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,The heat from your movements is slowing you down.
Dialogue: 99,1:25:38.57,1:25:40.91,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,It caught me, but—
Dialogue: 99,1:25:40.91,1:25:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,1:25:45.91,1:25:49.87,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,I didn't expect it to be this powerful.
Dialogue: 99,1:25:49.87,1:25:51.54,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Where is all this power coming from?
Dialogue: 99,1:25:51.54,1:25:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 99,1:25:59.34,1:26:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 99,1:26:00.34,1:26:01.72,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I found it.
Dialogue: 99,1:26:01.72,1:26:02.72,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Please make it.
Dialogue: 99,1:26:04.05,1:26:07.06,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,Why do you always interfere?
Dialogue: 99,1:26:07.97,1:26:09.81,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,We won't need it.
Dialogue: 99,1:26:09.81,1:26:13.31,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Without what you call absolute power,
Dialogue: 99,1:26:13.69,1:26:17.02,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,we'll be able to live free and strong.
Dialogue: 99,1:26:17.02,1:26:21.53,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,You, the one who awoke that monster, saying such a thing?
Dialogue: 99,1:26:21.53,1:26:24.41,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,That's why I have to end this.
Dialogue: 99,1:26:24.82,1:26:28.16,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,Humans often betray, fight, and do terrible things to each other,
Dialogue: 99,1:26:28.16,1:26:32.00,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,but if I can feel this heat and this pain in my heart.
Dialogue: 99,1:26:32.00,1:26:35.59,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,A future where everyone will be kind to each other will definitely come some day.
Dialogue: 99,1:26:35.59,1:26:38.21,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,I can believe in it now!
Dialogue: 99,1:26:41.84,1:26:43.34,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,I got you.
Dialogue: 99,1:26:45.26,1:26:45.85,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,Not yet,
Dialogue: 99,1:26:46.39,1:26:47.93,Default,Suo,0,0,0,,it's not over yet!
Dialogue: 99,1:26:49.31,1:26:52.94,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}No way. That's impossible!
Dialogue: 99,1:32:22.14,1:32:25.52,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sorry. I'm sorry.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,1:32:28.35,1:32:30.90,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thank you for everything.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,1:32:31.32,1:32:35.03,Default,Ame,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1200)\i1}Suou, I love you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.11,1:32:30.11,ED_Eng 1,,0,0,0,,
